  ["被大学录取",["被大学录取		To be accepted to a university","我很高兴我进入了大学。		I'm happy I got into college.","研究生入学		Graduate school admission","研究生		Graduate student","我能在研究生院学到很多东西吗？		Will I be able to learn a lot in graduate school?","因为这是一个图书馆，所以我可以读很多书。		Since it is a library, I am able to read many books.","两个月期间		Two-month period","终于被接受了		Finally got accepted","大家都在焦急地等待着考试。		Everyone is anxiously waiting for the exam.","我申请是因为教育是免费的。		I applied because the education was free.","问题消失		the problem disappears","问题会解决吗？		Will the problem be resolved?","未来的计划		plans for the future","未来的工作		Future jobs","未来的梦想		Dream of the future","既然放假了，我就会每天锻炼身体。		Since it's vacation, I will exercise every day.","放假了，我要去旅行。		Since it's vacation, I'm going on a trip.","因为放假了，我看书。		Because it's vacation, I read books.","因为放假了，我想见见我的朋友。		Since it's vacation, I want to meet my friends.","因为放假了，我要去见一个朋友。		Since it's vacation, I'm going to meet a friend.","因为放假了，我可以和我的朋友见面。		Because it's vacation, I can meet my friends.","焦虑消失		Anxiety disappears","我焦急地等待着。		I waited anxiously.","焦急地坐着		Sit anxiously","焦急地询问		Ask in an anxious manner","因为是摄影俱乐部，所以我学到了很多东西。		Since it's a photography club, I learn a lot.","你为什么报名摄影班？		Why did you sign up for the photography class?","摄影班容易上吗？		Is it easy to attend the photography class?","我们可以愉快地开始摄影课了。		We can happily start the photography class.","我买了一台相机，因为我有摄影课。		I bought a camera because I have a photography class.","轻松拍照		Take photos easily","我打算报名参加摄影班。		I’m planning to sign up for a photography class.","摄影师班什么时候开始？		When does the photographer class start?","我想成为一名摄影师。		I want to become a photographer.","我需要一名摄影师。		I need a photographer.","我很感兴趣，因为我是一名摄影师。		I'm very interested because I'm a photographer.","你认为我能成为一名成功的摄影师吗？		Do you think I can succeed as a photographer?","三向和四向交叉路口		Three-way and four-way intersections","三年期间		Three-year period","我很好奇，因为这是一个新模型。		I'm curious because it's a new model."]],
  ["一款新相机已经问世。",["一款新相机已经问世。		A new camera has come out.","我很高兴拥有一台新相机。		I'm delighted to have a new camera.","因为这是一台新相机，所以照片效果更好。		Because it's a new camera, the pictures come out better.","照片效果很好，因为这是一台新相机。		The photos come out well because it's a new camera.","因为这是一台新相机，所以我可以拍出好照片。		Because it’s a new camera, I can take good pictures.","一种新的关系		A new relationship","新相机问世		a new camera comes out","老师能简单解释一下吗？		Will the teacher explain it easily?","我想学习，因为老师很有名。		I want to learn because the teacher is famous.","因为他是老师，所以他教得很好。		Because he is a teacher, he teaches well.","注册课程		To register for a class","我报名是因为课程是免费的。		I signed up because the class was free.","我早上很早就醒了，因为我有课。		I woke up early in the morning because I had class.","轻松注册		Register easily","您可以轻松注册。		You can easily register.","你很容易理解。		You can easily understand it.","容易找到吗？		Can it be found easily?","压力消失		Stress disappears","考试期间我很焦虑。		I'm anxious due to the exam period.","我很忙，因为是考试期间。		I was busy because it was exam period.","通过考试后		After passing the exam","考试准备期		Exam preparation period","通过考试		To pass the exam","我会学习，因为我有考试。		I will study because I have an exam.","我很紧张，因为这是一次考试。		I'm nervous because it's an exam.","我因为考试而学习了很多。		I studied a lot because I had an exam.","夏季期间		Summer period","暑假我会焦急地等待。		I will wait anxiously during summer vacation.","因为是暑假，学生很多。		Because it is summer vacation, there are many students.","现在是夏天，天气会很热。		Since it's summer, the weather will be hot.","现在是夏天，天气很热。		It's summer, so the weather is hot.","因为是夏天，我想去海边。		Because it's summer, I want to go to the beach.","现在是夏天，我要去游泳池。		Since it's summer, I'm going to the swimming pool.","既然是夏天，我就看书。		Since it is summer, I read books.","既然是历史，就有很多值得学习的东西。		Since it is history, there are many things to learn.","左侧三路交叉口		Left side three-way intersection","我的父母为我感到骄傲。		My parents are proud of me.","危险的三路交叉口		Dangerous three-way intersection","著名研究生院		Famous graduate school","我注册是因为它是一所名校。		I registered because it’s a famous school."]]