  ["平坦区域",["平坦区域		the flat area","特莱维喷泉的照片		the photos at the Trevi Fountain","有关博物馆的信息含糊不清。		The information about the museum is vague.","她以尊敬的方式观察纪念碑。		She observes the monument in a respectful way.","她恭敬地与导游交谈。		She speaks respectfully with the tour guide.","我非常喜欢罗马食物。		I like Roman food very much.","我姐姐喜欢特莱维喷泉。		My sister loves the Trevi Fountain.","公园里，每一个生物似乎都很高兴。		In the park, every creature seems happy.","我迫不及待地想到达目的地。		I can't wait to reach the destination.","我不想用其他东西代替罗马披萨。		I don't want to replace Roman pizza with anything else.","今天我们一起去罗马斗兽场吗？		Are we going to the Colosseum together today?","今天我松了口气。		Today I feel relieved.","今天我们一起参观比萨斜塔。		Today we are visiting the Tower of Pisa together.","斗兽场里的每一个生物都似乎还活着。		Every creature in the Colosseum seems alive.","每一次胜利，都让旅途更加美好。		Every victory makes the journey more beautiful.","现在我可以安心地探索罗马了。		Now I am relieved to be able to explore Rome without worries.","我希望你能和主要团队一起来。		I would prefer that you come together with the main group.","天气好的时候我更喜欢在户外吃午餐。		I prefer to have lunch outdoors when the weather is nice.","今天我更喜欢待在室内。		I prefer to stay inside today.","可以更换红笔吗？		Can you replace the red pen?","列表中的下一个目的地是什么？		What's the next destination on the list?","行程什么时候出发？		When does the trip leave?","喷泉附近的那个生物真的很小。		That creature near the fountain was really small.","这种生物速度非常快。		This creature is very fast.","这个正方形是完全平坦的。		This square is completely flat.","这个广场纪念一场伟大的历史性胜利。		This square commemorates a great historic victory.","这所监狱非常古老。		This prison is very old.","这是一座古罗马神庙。		This is an ancient Roman temple.","你知道热那亚有很多历史建筑吗？		Do you know Genoa has many historic buildings?","让我们坐在这里欣赏海湾的景色。		Let's sit here and admire the view of the bay.","我们昨天到达了特莱维喷泉。		We arrived at the Trevi Fountain yesterday.","我终于松了口气。		I am finally relieved.","我松了一口气，因为我完成了作业。		I am relieved because I have finished the homework.","昨天我在博物馆里非常尊重。		I was very respectful in the museum yesterday.","我正在用一本新书替换旧书。		I am replacing the old book with a new one.","我们正在地图上寻找特莱维喷泉。		We are looking for the Trevi Fountain on the map.","如果我们和其他人一起来你会高兴吗？		Would you be happy if we came with others?","罗马斗兽场的一项任务		an assignment on the Colosseum","尊重他人的行为		respectful behavior","待更换的建筑物		a building to be replaced"]],
  ["决定性因素",["决定性因素		a decisive factor","一个重要因素		an important factor","罗马斗兽场的景色		a view from the Colosseum","尊敬的观众		a respectful audience","一种迷人的生物		a fascinating creature","一种古老的生物		an ancient creature","神秘生物		a mysterious creature","一个生物躲在柱子后面。		A creature is hiding behind the column.","斗兽场前的照片		a photo in front of the Colosseum","热那亚之旅		a trip to Genoa","外出旅行		a trip outside","一个小生物		a small creature","要更换的雕像		a statue to be replaced","罗马别墅		a Roman villa","参观特莱维喷泉		a visit to the Trevi Fountain","罗马斗兽场景观		a view of the Colosseum","重要的胜利		an important victory","去看比萨斜塔		to see the Tower of Pisa","我希望您做好参观水族馆的准备。		I want you to come prepared to visit the Aquarium.","我明天想去罗马斗兽场。		I want to see the Colosseum tomorrow.","我想参观热那亚水族馆。		I would like to see the Genoa Aquarium.","你愿意和我一起去比萨斜塔吗？		Would you like to go up the Tower of Pisa with me?","您想参观热那亚的历史中心吗？		Would you like to see the historic center of Genoa?","还有一种用物品代替金钱的方法。		There is also a method of exchanging goods instead of money.","我没听懂昨天课的要点。		I did not understand the main points of yesterday's class.","童鞋		children's shoes","这款平板电脑可以在任何地方使用，而且很方便。		This tablet can be used anywhere and is convenient.","这个问题的要点是什么？		What is the main point of this problem?","这个观点是合乎逻辑的，不是吗。		This opinion is logical, isn't it?","你刚才听到有人的声音吗？		Did you hear somebody's voice just now?","我代替老师收作业。		I collected the homework instead of the teacher.","那么，也请帮忙打扫一下。		Then, please help with the cleaning too.","那之后，你能帮我去拿鸡蛋吗？		After that, could you go get the eggs for me?","你是如何提高英语水平的？		How did you improve your English?","我想要一个可以在任何地方使用的应用程序。		I would like an app I can use anywhere.","我想听到大家更多的声音。		I would like to hear more from everyone.","让我收集一下大家的意见。		Let me gather everyone's opinions.","我想进一步提高我的成绩。		I want to improve my grades further.","我们需要尽快采取行动，不是吗。		We need to take action sooner, don't we.","我去开空调，好吧。		I'll turn on the air conditioner, okay?"]],
  ["蛋糕很好。",["蛋糕很好。		Cake is fine.","蛋糕可以吗？		Is cake okay?","您想要茶而不是咖啡吗？		Would you like tea instead of coffee?","沙拉还可以。		Salad is fine.","我将收集测试结果。		I will collect the test results.","我很抱歉忘记带笔记本。		I apologize for forgetting my notebook.","我将打开投影仪。		I'll turn on the projector.","报告的要点是什么？		What are the report's main points?","中山收集了这些报告。		Nakayama collected the reports.","您主要与哪个国家进行贸易？		Which country do you mainly trade with?","大部分是年轻人开始从事这项业务。		Mostly young people started this business.","热门课		popular class","今天我要吃便当。		I'll have a bento today.","和其他朋友一起学习也很有趣。		Studying with other friends is also fun.","如果还有其他意见，请告诉我。		If there are other opinions, please let me know.","我们来谈谈其他方法。		Let's talk about other methods.","您在其他科目中也使用平板电脑吗？		Do you use tablets in other subjects too?","相反，我们计划出售西红柿。		Instead, we plan to sell tomatoes.","相反，我正在种植西红柿。		Instead, I am growing tomatoes.","你想尝试种植西红柿吗？		Would you like to try growing tomatoes instead?","你可以带鸡蛋吗？		Could you bring eggs instead?","相反，今天一位朋友帮助了我。		Instead, a friend helped me today.","相反，我改变了浇水时间。		Instead, I changed the watering time.","公司上调产品价格。		The company raised product prices.","健康牛		healthy cow","首先我打开投影仪。		First I turned on the projector.","老师为我们打开了空调。		The teacher turned on the air conditioner for us.","老师没有解释，而是学生们展示。		Instead of the teacher explaining, the students presented.","田中将代替老师发言。		In place of the teacher, Tanaka will present.","你能代替老师解释一下吗？		Would you explain in the teacher's place?","老师说你可以在任何地方提问。		The teacher said that you can ask questions anywhere.","我代替我的高年级同学打扫教室。		I cleaned the classroom instead of my upperclassman.","明确要点		clear main points","如果你在学习上遇到困难，请先尝试采取小步骤。		If you struggle with studying, please try taking small steps first.","我增加了学习时间并提高了成绩。		I increased my study time and improved my grades.","我们应该制作一个单词列表吗？		Should we make a word list?","问题的要点 【177】大牛		the main point of the problem","大牛		big cow","在大学里，我主要学习经济学。		In college, I mainly study economics.","我为忘记做作业而道歉。		I apologize for forgetting my homework."]],
  ["本课要点",["本课要点		the lesson's main points","课堂材料中，有一张孩子牵着母亲的手的照片。		In the class materials, there was a photo of a child holding their mother's hand.","如果你在课堂上有问题，你会怎么做？ [[183]​​] 教科书照片中，有一个男人抓住同伴手臂帮忙的场景？		If you have a question during class, what do you do?","教科书照片中，有一个男人抓住同伴手臂帮忙的场景。		In the textbook photo, there was a scene of a man taking hold of his companion's arm to help.","也有人不看课本，而是通过看视频来学习。		Instead of reading textbooks, there are also people who study by watching videos.","我穿着新鞋来。		I came wearing new shoes.","我想买新鞋，你会推荐哪里？		I want to buy new shoes, where would you recommend?","明天的课几点开始？		What time does tomorrow's class start?","有时我忘记打开空调。		Sometimes I forget to turn on the air conditioner.","如今，您可以在任何地方参加在线课程。		These days, you can take online classes anywhere.","真实的声音		true voice","下周的课程将有一个测试。		There will be a test in next week's class.","趣味课		fun class","下一堂课是什么？		What is the next class?","接下来我要喝橙汁。		I'll have orange juice next.","历史词汇		history vocabulary","牛肉可以制成许多不同的菜肴。		Beef can be made into many different dishes.","我将代替田中进行演示。		I will give the presentation instead of Tanaka.","田中先生的声音非常温柔。		Mr. Tanaka has a very gentle voice.","如果你有目标，采取行动就很重要。		If you have a goal, taking action is important.","社会规则		society's rules","社会研究课很有趣，不是吗。		The social studies class is interesting, isn't it?","社会知识		social knowledge","我正在收集大家的意见。		I am collecting opinions from everyone.","对我来说，橙汁很好。		For me, orange juice is fine.","听到答案我立刻就明白了意思。		I was able to grasp the meaning immediately after hearing the answer.","要点总结		summary of the main points","逻辑分析		logical analysis","你能告诉我一个合乎逻辑的理由吗？		Could you tell me a logical reason?","你能解释一下其中的逻辑吗？		Could you explain the logic?","逻辑答案		logical answer","逻辑经济学		logical economics","逻辑思维		logical thought","要点		key main points","即使是一个困难的话题，你也可以抓住重要的事情。		Even with a difficult topic, you can grasp the important things.","我在笔记本上写难的单词。		I write difficult words in a notebook.","为了换取高税收，政府提供许多服务。		In exchange for high taxes, the government provides many services.","当空气干净时，我的注意力会很好。		When the air is clean, I focus well.","我想，如果空气变得更好，每个人都会更舒服。		If the air gets better, everyone will be more comfortable, I think.","你可以把水果放进这个袋子里。		You can put the fruit in this bag."]],
  ["教室空气太闷了。",["教室空气太闷了。		The classroom air is too stuffy.","当你关掉教室的灯时，最好再检查一次。		When you turn off the classroom lights, it is good to check one more time.","教室里的空气有点闷。		In the classroom the air is a bit stuffy.","在课堂上，我们是否应该尽量减少一次性用品的使用？		In the classroom, shall we try to reduce the use of disposable products?","清洁的空气对健康非常重要。		Clean air is really important for health.","需要更多干净的水瓶。		More clean water bottles are needed.","干净的纸巾		clean paper towel","我最近改变了我的习惯。		I recently changed my habits.","这些天我也在努力改变我的习惯。		I’m also trying to change my habits these days.","我明天野餐肯定需要一瓶水。		I definitely need a water bottle for the picnic tomorrow.","为了明天的野餐，我们提前准备好水瓶吧。		For tomorrow's picnic, let's prepare the water bottles in advance.","明天，我们带上午餐出发吧。		Tomorrow, let's pack a lunch and go.","明天，我们带上午餐去公园吧。		Tomorrow, let's pack a lunch and go to the park.","你经常去二手服装店吗？		Do you often go to secondhand clothing stores?","你要带水瓶吗？		Are you going to bring a water bottle?","你经常穿二手衣服吗？		Do you often wear secondhand clothes?","你经常叫外卖吗？		Do you order takeout often?","你也可以带水瓶吗？		Can you bring a water bottle too?","你也想改变你的习惯吗？		Do you also want to change your habits?","你也在考虑改变你的习惯吗？		Are you thinking of changing your habits too?","我认为你的想法非常好。		Your idea is really good, I think.","你在想什么主意？		What idea are you thinking of?","如果你改变习惯，会有帮助。		If you change your habits, it will help.","如果你尝试的话，其实并不难。		If you try, it really won't be hard.","谁没带塑料叉子？		Who didn't bring a plastic fork?","谁来带塑料叉子？		Who is going to bring the plastic forks?","装饭盒之前，我们先一起准备一下食材。		Before packing the lunchbox, let's prepare the ingredients together.","我随身携带的包很小，所以很不方便。		The bag I carry around is small, so it's inconvenient.","扔掉东西之前请三思。		Please think twice before throwing things away.","两个水瓶		two water bottles","如果你随身携带水瓶，就可以减少塑料的使用。		If you carry a water bottle around, you can reduce plastic.","一个带水瓶的朋友		a friend who brings a water bottle","未来之城		city of the future","我希望未来的城市有更多的绿色空间。		I hope future cities will have more green spaces.","让我们一起解决未来的问题。		Let's solve future problems together.","未来社会		future society","让我们为地球的未来共同努力。		Let's work together for Earth's future.","未来之家		house of the future","包内物品		items inside the bag","我可以不带袋子带走物品吗？		Could I take the items without a bag?"]],
  ["没有包，提东西很困难。",["没有包，提东西很困难。		Without a bag, carrying things is hard.","您无需将其放入包中，只需随身携带即可。		Instead of putting it in a bag, you can just carry it.","随身携带布袋而不是塑料袋是很好的选择。		Carrying a cloth bag around instead of a plastic bag is good.","我没有带塑料袋，而是带了购物袋。		Instead of a plastic bag, I brought a shopping bag.","使用购物袋代替塑料袋。		Instead of using plastic bags, use a shopping bag.","打扫办公室时，纸巾是绝对必要的。		When cleaning the office, paper towels are absolutely necessary.","我把它送到了办公室。		I had it delivered to the office.","交付到办公室的订单		an order for delivery to the office","办公室里的纸巾似乎不够。		It seems there are not enough paper towels in the office.","新产品订单		new product order","新产品中，哪一款最好？		Among the new products, which one is the best?","新品折扣		new product discount","新款二手衣服		new secondhand clothes","我们要和老师谈谈使用一次性用品吗？		Shall we talk to the teacher about using disposable products?","一个改变习惯的家庭		a family that changes habits","改变习惯的好机会		a good opportunity to change habits","通过改变习惯，您可以减少垃圾。		By changing your habits, you can reduce trash.","携带去市场的购物袋		a shopping bag to carry to the market","你能再清空一次垃圾桶吗？		Can you empty the trash can one more time?","今天在超市，我安排送纸巾。		Today at the supermarket, I arranged for paper towels to be delivered.","今天买了很多东西，非常需要一个包。		I bought lots of things today, so I really need a bag.","今天我脑子里突然冒出一个好主意。		A good idea popped into my head today.","让我们都开始改变小习惯吧。		Let's all start changing small habits.","我们一起打包午餐吧！		Let's pack lunch together!","我们总是重复使用同一个袋子。		We always reuse the same bag.","我们的计划		our plan","我们的办公室		our office","我们的新电脑		our new computer","我们的文件		our documents","我们的选择		our choice","我们的员工		our employees","我们的办公桌		our desk","这个想法有助于减少塑料。		This idea helps reduce plastic.","我已经购买了塑料叉子，我可以再次使用它吗？		I already bought a plastic fork, can I use it again?","这次野餐，我们不要使用塑料叉子。		For this picnic, let's not use plastic forks.","这次我们应该订购新产品吗？		Should we order the new product this time?","这次我想打包午餐而不是外卖。		This time, I want to pack a lunch instead of takeout food.","由于新办公室需要很多物资，我就派人送货了。		Since the new office needed many supplies, I had them delivered.","热门新品		popular new product","我认为停止使用一次性产品很重要。		I think it is important to stop using disposable products."]],
  ["没有一次性用品的教室",["没有一次性用品的教室		a classroom without disposable items","我们可以在没有一次性用品的情况下吃午饭吗？		Could we eat lunch without disposables?","当您使用大量一次性物品时，就会产生更多垃圾。		When you use a lot of disposable items, there is more trash.","一次性用品太多，垃圾增多。		There are too many disposable products, so the trash has increased.","我没有开车来，而是步行来的。		Instead of coming by car, I came on foot.","小的改变似乎并不难。		Small changes don't seem hard.","小袋子里的水果		fruit in a small bag","改变小习惯的改变		a change that alters small habits","我总是随身携带一个购物袋。		I always carry around a shopping bag.","两盏灯		two lights","学生关灯		student turning off the light","请获取电子邮件收据而不是纸质收据。		Please get an email receipt instead of a paper receipt.","我不使用纸巾，而是使用布。		Instead of using paper towels, I use a cloth.","如果有纸巾，清洁就更方便了。		If there are paper towels, cleaning is more convenient.","如果你穿二手衣服，你可以省钱。		If you wear secondhand clothes, you can save money.","我们是否应该重新决定清洁时间？		Should we decide on the cleaning time again?","清洁时，纸巾是绝对必要的。		When cleaning, paper towels are absolutely necessary.","与朋友一起打包午餐的计划		a plan to pack a lunch with a friend","如果你和朋友一起做就不难了。		It won't be hard if you do it with a friend.","打包外卖食品的时间到了		time to pack takeout food","太多的外卖意味着更多的垃圾。		Too much takeout means more trash.","使用玻璃瓶代替塑料瓶怎么样？		How about using glass bottles instead of plastic?","我没有使用塑料杯，而是使用了玻璃杯。		Instead of a plastic cup, I used a glass cup.","我们不要使用太多塑料叉子。		Let's not use too many plastic forks.","不必要的一次性产品		unnecessary disposable products","一位已交付必需物品的同事		a colleague who has the necessary items delivered","一家人一起打包午餐盒		family packing lunchboxes together","共同创造的想法		an idea created together","你去杂货店购物时会带什么？		What do you take with you when you go grocery shopping?","请问还有塑料叉子吗？		By any chance, are there any plastic forks left?","一个并不困难的对话		a conversation that is not difficult","一个并不困难的改变		a change that is not difficult","生活并不艰难		a life that is not hard","成熟的香蕉会变得更甜。		A ripe banana gets sweeter.","蓝蝴蝶		the blue butterfly","缺乏水分会使植物干燥。		The lack of moisture leaves the plants dry.","薄荷叶闻起来很香。		A mint leaf smells great.","我们应该尽可能测量湿度。		We should measure the humidity whenever possible.","我们应该充分浇水，这样植物才能更好地生长。		We should water well so the plants hold up better.","我们用新耙子清理了花园。		We cleaned the garden with the new rake."]],
  ["我们在空地上种了花。",["我们在空地上种了花。		We planted flowers on the lot.","我们今天种植了不同的物种。		We planted a different species today.","我们也可以在沙拉中使用薄荷。		We can use mint in the salad too.","我们可以在沙拉中使用薄荷。		We can use mint in the salad.","我们需要选择耐高温的种子。		We need to choose seeds that withstand the heat.","我们需要等待草莓成熟。		We need to wait for the strawberry to ripen.","我们需要在浇水之前测量湿度。		We need to measure moisture before watering.","我们一起采摘了许多成熟的西红柿。		We have been picking many ripe tomatoes together.","我们要在那块地上种花。		We are going to plant flowers on that lot.","今天我们将只移除最弱的分支。		We are going to remove only the weakest branches today.","薄荷在阳光下生长良好。		Mint grows well in the sun.","薄荷在春天生长得很快。		Mint grows quickly in the spring.","薄荷生长良好。		The mint is growing well.","薄荷需要充足的阳光才能生长旺盛。		Mint needs plenty of sun to grow strong.","院子的清洁		the cleaning of the yard","芒果树开满了花。		The mango tree is full of flowers.","芒果树长满了叶子。		The mango tree is full of leaves.","芒果树上结满了芒果。		The mango tree is full of mangoes.","芒果树需要阳光才能生长良好。		The mango tree needs sun to grow well.","种子需要水才能生长。		A seed needs water to grow.","种子需要良好的土壤才能生长。		Seeds need good soil to grow.","干种子		the dry seed","修剪技术		the technique for pruning","理想湿度		the ideal humidity","我找到了一个干燥的地方来存放工具。		I found a dry place to store the tools.","那棵大芒果树		that big mango tree","这里有一颗小种子。		There is a small seed here.","请小心地拔出那棵植物。		Pull out that plant carefully, please.","拔出干燥花 【[62]]拔出老花		to pull out the dry flowers","拔出旧花		to pull out the old flowers","树种		the species of trees","夏季过后，叶子干燥。		The leaves are dry after the summer.","叶子在强烈的阳光下晒干了。		The leaves dried out in the strong sun.","成熟的水果更适合制作果汁。		Ripe fruit is better for making juice.","锅里的种子		the seeds in the pot","种子需要良好的土壤。		The seeds need good soil.","种子小而轻。		The seeds are small and light.","有时蝴蝶停在树叶的树荫下。		Sometimes the butterflies rest in the shade of the leaves.","将耙子放在其他工具旁边。		Put the rake next to the other tools.","我把薄荷放在厨房花盆里。		I put mint in the kitchen flowerpot."]],
  ["我在市场上买了罗勒种子。",["我在市场上买了罗勒种子。		I bought basil seeds at the market.","在家种植香菜		growing cilantro at home","在盆里种植薄荷		to grow mint in a pot","在厨房里种植欧芹		grow parsley in the kitchen","在家种植草药		growing herbs at home","种植新鲜香草		to grow fresh herbs","开垦花园		to cultivate a garden","撒完种子后，我们聊了起来。		After scattering the seeds, we talked.","给花园浇水后，我们看到了几只蜜蜂。		After watering the garden, we saw several bees.","种完花后，我们给花园浇水。		After planting the flowers, we watered the garden.","种完花后，我给花园浇水。		After planting the flowers, I watered the garden.","很难从这里拔出那棵树。		It is difficult to pull out that tree from here.","修剪对于植物生长良好非常重要。		It is important to prune so that the plants grow well.","她在购买前比较了这些植物。		She compared the plants before buying.","她一直精心照料花园。		She has been tending the garden lovingly.","他在购买工厂之前没有进行检查。		He didn't check before he bought the plant.","那棵芒果树需要更多的阳光。		That mango tree needs more sun.","这些花能很好地抵御风吹。		These flowers withstand the wind well.","这些植物需要抵御寒冷。		Those plants need to withstand the cold.","这个鳄梨还没有成熟。		This avocado is not yet ripe.","那根树枝昨天掉到了地上。		That branch fell to the ground yesterday.","那根绿树枝		that green branch","我自己无法拔出那株植物。		I can't pull out that plant by myself.","我在买种子之前搜索过。		I searched before I bought the seeds.","我在旅行前给花园浇了水。		I watered the garden before I traveled.","花园里有许多不同的物种。		There are many different species in the garden.","院子里的花		yard flowers","将种子存放在干燥的地方。		Store the seeds in a dry place.","保存该种子以供明年使用。		Save that seed for next year.","你尝试过用薄荷和酸奶做酱汁吗？		Have you ever tried making sauce with mint and yogurt?","我的喷壶是绿色的，很小。		My watering can is green and small.","我妈妈总是用薄荷来泡茶。		My mother always uses mint to make tea.","许多种类的昆虫有助于植物生长。		Many species of insects help plants grow.","菜园里，西红柿长势良好。		In the vegetable garden, the tomatoes are growing well.","我在商店找不到香菜籽。		I couldn't find coriander seeds at the store.","请不要在酒店各处乱扔垃圾。		Do not leave trash scattered across the property, please.","拔出健康的花是不好的。		It is not good to pull out healthy flowers.","今天别忘了给薄荷浇水。		Don't forget to water the mint today.","别忘了每天给薄荷浇水。		Don't forget to water the mint every day.","在我们的花园里，总会出现一些蝴蝶。		In our garden, some butterfly always appears."]],
  ["秋天，修剪植物很重要。",["秋天，修剪植物很重要。		In the fall, it is important to prune the plants.","我们的菜园里种满了西红柿。		Our vegetable garden is full of tomatoes.","耙子对清洁花园有很大帮助。		The rake helps a lot in cleaning the garden.","土壤中的耙子		the rake in the soil","这里一月的空气总是比较干燥。		The air in January is always drier here.","干燥的地面		the dry ground","薄荷的气味非常宜人。		The smell of mint is very pleasant.","成熟的草莓呈鲜红色。		A ripe strawberry has a bright red color.","湿度水平		the level of humidity","成熟的甜椒		the ripe bell pepper","今天院子里开满了花。		The yard is full of flowers today.","这棵树的树枝很重。		The branch of this tree is heavy.","花园里的树枝		the branch from the garden","新分支		the new branch","树枝在强风中折断了。		The branch snapped in the strong wind.","蓝色喷壶		the blue watering can","塑料喷壶		the plastic watering can","花园的喷壶		the garden's watering can","植物附近的喷壶		the watering can near the plants","你的后院比我的大。		Your backyard is bigger than mine.","今天地上长满了干树叶。		The ground is full of dry leaves today.","这片土地上满是干树叶。		The lot is full of dry leaves.","该地段需要更多鲜花。		The lot needs more flowers.","今天需要清洁该地段。		The lot needs to be cleaned today.","准备好的土地		the prepared land","西红柿很熟了。		The tomato is very ripe.","西红柿已经熟了。		The tomato is already ripe.","树干看起来干燥脆弱。		The trunk of the tree seems dry and fragile.","耙子的使用		the use of the rake","谢谢你帮我选择种子。		Thank you for helping me choose seeds.","谢谢你给我关于薄荷的建议。		Thank you for giving me tips about mint.","谢谢你给我罗勒种子。		Thank you for giving me basil seeds.","谢谢你教我有关薄荷的知识。		Thank you for teaching me about mint.","您喜欢把耙子放在哪里？		Where do you prefer to leave the rake?","一起种植对每个人都有好处。		Planting together can be beneficial for everyone.","修剪老植物		to prune the old plants","我们现在可以修剪那些花吗？		Can we prune those flowers now?","将种子放在阳光充足的地方。		Put the seed in a sunny place.","为什么湿度对植物如此重要？		Why is humidity so important for plants?","我们需要等西瓜成熟了才能吃。		We need to wait for the watermelon to ripen before eating."]],
  ["下雨时，拔起植物更容易。",["下雨时，拔起植物更容易。		When it rains, it is easier to pull up the plants.","我什么时候应该修剪花园里的花朵？		When should I prune the flowers in the garden?","如果你现在种植，植物可能无法过冬。		If you plant now, the plant may not survive the winter.","没有喷壶，植物很快就会干燥。		Without a watering can, the plants dry quickly.","今天花园里有蝴蝶飞舞。		There are butterflies flying around the garden today.","有足够的薄荷可以和我分享吗？		Is there enough mint to share with me?","菜园里长着西红柿。		There are tomatoes growing in the vegetable garden.","那边长着一种奇怪的果实。		There is a strange fruit growing over there.","你的车库里有新的喷壶吗？		Is there a new watering can in your garage?","树枝上长着一朵漂亮的花。		There is a pretty flower growing on the branch.","我的后院有一个小菜园。		There is a small vegetable garden in my backyard.","花园中央有一棵芒果树。		There is a mango tree right in the center of the garden.","连根拔起那棵树是令人悲伤的。		Uprooting that tree was sad.","种植这是一个好主意。		Having planted that was a good idea.","种下一棵芒果树是最好的事情。		To have planted a mango tree was the best thing.","修剪那棵树真是太好了。		It was good to have pruned that tree.","使用它有很大帮助。		Having used that helped a lot.","有益效果		a beneficial effect","小果子		a small fruit","健康的水果		a healthy fruit","一个维护良好的院子		a well-kept yard","种满植物的后院		a backyard full of plants","一个小分支		a small branch","一个空喷壶		an empty watering can","有益的用途		a beneficial use","一个干花瓶		a dry vase","有益的行动		a beneficial action","后院的一棵树		a tree in the backyard","树叶间的蝴蝶		a butterfly among the leaves","一只小蝴蝶		a small butterfly","后院的一把椅子		a chair in the backyard","一个有益的选择		a beneficial choice","最喜欢的物种		a favorite species","精心照料的菜园		a well-tended vegetable garden","花园里的一棵芒果树		a mango tree in the garden","有益植物		a beneficial plant","罗勒种子		a basil seed","一把修枝剪		a pair of pruning shears","使用耙子		to use the rake","使用耙子收集干树叶。		Use the rake to gather the dry leaves."]],
  ["明天我们去芒果树上摘芒果吧。",["明天我们去芒果树上摘芒果吧。		Let's pick the mangoes from the mango tree tomorrow.","我在花园里看到一只蓝色蝴蝶。		I saw a blue butterfly in the garden.","我在你的花园里看到一只蓝色蝴蝶。		I saw a blue butterfly in your garden.","你认为叶子能撑得住吗？		Do you think the leaves will hold up?","你觉得柠檬熟了吗？		Do you think the lemon is ripe?","你喜欢薄荷茶吗？		Do you like mint tea?","你学会修剪了吗？		Have you learned to prune well yet?","今天你打扫干净了吗？		Have you cleaned the lot today?","你菜园里种过生菜了吗？		Have you planted lettuce in the vegetable garden yet?","你种过罗勒种子吗？		Have you ever planted a basil seed?","今天你种下种子了吗？		Have you planted any seeds today?","你种过薄荷吗？		Have you ever planted mint?","今天早上你给菜园浇水了吗？		Did you water the vegetable garden this morning?","今天你已经看过菜园了吗？		Have you already seen the vegetable garden today?","你在这里见过这个物种吗？		Have you ever seen this species here?","今天你看到黄色蝴蝶了吗？		Have you seen a yellow butterfly today?","你能帮我拿一下耙子吗？		Can you get the rake for me?","盆干了可以给植物浇水吗？		Can you water the plants since the pot is dry?","你修剪过花园后面的树吗？		Have you been pruning the trees in the back of the garden?","你每天都在给植物浇水。		You have been watering the plants every day.","你看到那只蓝色蝴蝶了吗？		Did you see that blue butterfly?","你一直把新的种子带到这里种植。		You have been bringing new seeds to plant here.","我要把这里所有的干树叶都拔掉。		I am going to pull off all the dry leaves from here.","一名跑步者摔倒在跑道上。		A runner fell down on the track.","我们每次比赛安娜都赢了。		Anna has won every time that we've raced.","参加体操比赛的运动员实力极强！		Athletes who compete in gymnastics are extremely strong!","两个滑雪板都必须完全越过线。		Both skis have to cross the line completely.","但我们完全遵守了规则！		But we followed the rules perfectly!","我可以借你的滑雪板过周末吗？		Can I borrow your skis for the weekend?","加油，我知道我们可以击败对方！		Come on, I know we can beat the other team!","来吧，跑吧！		Come on, run!","加油，只剩下两分钟了！		Come on, there are only two minutes left!","加油，这是最后一公里！		Come on, this is the last mile!","加油，你可以打破纪录！		Come on, you can beat the record!","加油，你能行的！		Come on, you can do it!","你看到他跳多高了吗？		Did you see how high he jumped?","你看到她击球有多高了吗？		Did you see how high she hit the ball?","你认为有人可以打破他的纪录吗？		Do you think anyone can beat his record?","你们学校有体操队吗？		Does your school have a gymnastics team?","艾玛是队长。		Emma is the team captain."]],
  ["每个人都会观看决赛。",["每个人都会观看决赛。		Everybody is going to be watching the final.","五十名自行车手将参加比赛。		Fifty cyclists will compete.","体操是一项困难的运动！		Gymnastics is a difficult sport!","你看过跳水比赛吗？		Have you ever watched a diving competition?","你的滑雪板是怎么坏的？		How did you break your snowboard?","有多少自行车手参加了比赛？		How many cyclists were in the race?","有多少支队伍参加决赛？		How many teams are competing in the final?","我不认为狩猎可以成为一种爱好。		I don't think that hunting can be a hobby.","我希望感觉好一点，这样我就可以打球了！		I hope to feel better so I can play!","我丢了一块滑雪板！		I lost one of my skis!","我当天租了滑雪板和头盔。		I rented a snowboard and a helmet for the day.","我想我们绕着跑道跑了一百次！		I think we ran around the track a hundred times!","我曾经做过体操，但现在我是一名自行车手。		I used to do gymnastics, but now I'm a cyclist.","我在高中时是一名游泳运动员。		I was a swimmer in high school.","我永远不会去打猎，因为我喜欢动物。		I'd never go hunting because I love animals.","我害怕和她赛跑！		I'm afraid of racing against her!","我很高兴他戴着头盔！		I'm glad he was wearing a helmet!","如果我们希望进入决赛，我们必须提高我们的进攻。		If we hope to be in the final, we must improve our offense.","可怕的是人们仍然捕猎动物。		It's terrible that people still hunt animals.","保持滑雪板笔直！		Keep your skis straight!","卢克希望参加周五的比赛。		Luke hopes to play in the game on Friday.","Max期望赢得学校跳水冠军。		Max expects to win the school diving championship.","我儿子参加学校跳水队比赛。		My son competes on his school's diving team.","下周就是决赛了！		Next week is the final!","没有人能打破这一纪录！		No one will ever beat that record!","不，应该不会有任何问题。		No, there shouldn't be any problems.","我们当然希望能进入决赛。		Of course we hope to make it to the final.","人们过去常常捕猎动物作为食物。		People used to hunt animals for food.","她没想到会得到满分。		She didn't expect to receive a perfect score.","她游得非常快！		She's a really fast swimmer!","滑雪板比滑雪板窄得多。		Skis are much narrower than snowboards.","游泳者们，准备好！		Swimmers, get ready!","运动员们以令人难以置信的速度在跑道上奔跑！		The athletes raced down the track at incredible speeds!","球飞得很高。		The ball went high in the air.","队长提醒队员们要坚强。		The captain reminded her players to be strong.","两队队长在场地中央相遇。		The captains from both teams met in the middle of the field.","教练与进攻组讨论了新的计划。		The coach discussed the new plan with the offense.","这对夫妇完美地完成了他们的日常工作。		The couple did their routine perfectly.","骑自行车的人放慢了速度，抓起一瓶水。		The cyclist slowed down and grabbed a bottle of water.","自行车手将穿越法国乡村。		The cyclists will race through the French countryside."]],
  ["设备坏了。",["设备坏了。		The equipment was broken.","曲棍球比赛前冰面非常光滑。		The ice was perfectly smooth before the hockey game.","球队希望赢得他们的第一个冠军。		The team hopes to win their first championship.","这位著名的自行车运动员出现在许多电视广告中。		The well-known cyclist has appeared in many TV ads.","他们的防守比进攻更好。		Their defense is better than their offense.","他们的进攻太可怕了！		Their offense is terrible!","没有什么比赢得比赛更好的感觉了！		There can't be any better feeling than winning a race!","不能有任何错误！		There can't be any mistakes!","赛道上不能有任何摄影师。		There can't be any photographers on the track.","获胜者不得超过一名。		There can't be more than one winner.","场上可能没有足够的球员。		There may not be enough players on the field.","可能没有足够的时间再进球。		There may not be enough time to score another goal.","今年六月可能会有一场体操比赛。		There might be a gymnastics competition this June.","可能有平局！		There might be a tie!","我们可能可以使用另一条轨道。		There might be another track we can use.","未来可能会遇到更多挑战。		There might be more challenges in the future.","明年可能不会有比赛。		There might not be a tournament next year.","可能不会再有另一场比赛了。		There might not be another race.","不应该有任何抱怨！		There should not be any complaints!","泳池里不应该有鸭子！		There should not be any ducks in the pool!","潜水区内不应有任何游泳者。		There should not be any swimmers in the diving area.","此活动不应有年龄限制。		There shouldn't be an age limit for this event.","水中不应该有人。		There shouldn't be anybody in the water.","泳池中的游泳者不得超过六人。		There shouldn't be more than six swimmers in the pool.","他们拥有联盟中最好的进攻。		They have the best offense in the league.","他们希望为下周的决赛做好准备。		They hope to be ready for the final next week.","该设备由硬塑料和金属制成。		This equipment is made of hard plastic and metal.","这个头盔非常适合我。		This helmet fits me perfectly.","这头盔太大了！		This helmet is too big!","为了赢得决赛，我们必须提高防守。		To win the final, we have to improve our defense.","我们从未想过会赢。		We never expected to win.","骑摩托车时请戴头盔。		Wear a helmet whenever you ride a motorcycle.","滑雪需要什么装备？		What kind of equipment do we need for skiing?","你什么时候比赛？		What time will you race?","体操比赛哪个国家获胜？		Which country won the gymnastics competition?","你预计谁会获胜？		Who do you expect to win?","现在谁在比赛？		Who's racing right now?","这支球队的队长是谁？		Who's the captain of this team?","那个戴绿盔的家伙是谁？		Who's the guy with the green helmet?","为什么赛道上有一只猫？		Why is there a cat on the track?"]],
  ["你今天的防守非常出色！",["你今天的防守非常出色！		Your defense was excellent today!","啊，你是说你已经做了头发，认真的吗？		Ah, you're saying you had done your hair, seriously?","在这里你可以听到飞行员的指示，哇！		You can hear the pilot's directions here, wow!","哦，如果有人在后备箱里怎么办？		Oh, what if someone was in the trunk?","我认为他用他的表情回答了我的问题。		I think he answered my question with his look.","对不起，我对拳击手一无所知！		Excuse me, I don't know anything about boxers!","对不起，我预订了靠过道的座位。		Excuse me, I reserved the aisle seat.","说真的，他是故意选择那个发型的吗？		Seriously, did he choose that haircut on purpose?","所以，你的丈夫是安娜的表弟，我不相信你！		So, your husband is Ana's cousin, I don't believe you!","那么，最后他们是在后备箱里吗？		So, in the end they were in the trunk?","那个发型简直就是一场噩梦，你在开玩笑吧！		That haircut is a nightmare, you're kidding me!","很开心，一起坐飞机旅行多好啊！		I'm happy, how nice to travel on an airplane together!","有些人一眼就能杀死你。		There are people who can kill you with a single look.","即使是呆在家里的人也可以做头发。		Even people who stay at home are able to do their hair.","描述这幅画的唯一词是令人惊讶。		The only word that describes this painting is surprising.","老实说，你的画很令人惊讶。		Honestly, your paintings are surprising.","这个画廊的价格令人惊讶。		The prices in this gallery are surprising.","这看起来很疯狂，你在开玩笑吧！		It seems like craziness, you're kidding me!","我的祖父是十个儿子中的第八个。		My grandfather was the eighth son of ten.","看看飞行员的帽子，多优雅啊！		Look at the pilot's cap, how elegant!","不要拿政治开玩笑，因为我不能笑这个。		Don't joke about politics because I can't laugh about that.","我不明白，她把头发弄成这样是为了看起来轻松吗？		I don't understand, does she do her hair like this to look relaxed?","我简直不敢相信，真的吗？		I can't believe it, seriously?","你在开玩笑吧，现在他却做了相反的事！		You're kidding me, and now he's doing the opposite!","别拍我，我不想成为名人。		Don't film me, I don't want to be a celebrity.","不可能，我刚刚做了头发！		It can't be, I just did my hair!","不可能吧，他们在驾驶舱里抽烟？		It can't be, they're smoking in the cockpit?","我不相信你，他开玩笑说他的猫死了？		I don't believe you, he joked about the death of his cat?","别脸红，我开玩笑的！		Don't turn red, I was joking!","看来他们在开我们的玩笑。		It seems that they're pulling our leg.","我的意思是，他怎么能在他的雕塑中使用皮革？		I mean, how can he use leather in his sculptures?","我的意思是，你相信电缆是一件艺术品吗？		I mean, did you believe that cable was a work of art?","太奇怪了，你听到机舱里有声音吗？		How strange, do you hear that noise in the cabin?","记者的评论太令人惊讶了。		The journalist's comments were so surprising.","他做头发时看起来更好，你不觉得吗？		He looks better when he does his hair, don't you think?","如果你向后走，你就会摔倒。		If you walk backwards, you're going to fall.","如果他们拍摄这个节目，我需要换个新发型！		If they film the show, I'll need a new haircut!","我发誓他把酱汁打翻了，我看到他了。		I swear that he spilled the sauce, I saw him.","这一定是谎言，你在开玩笑吧！		It has to be a lie, you're kidding me!","大家都会看你的，把头发做好吧！		Everyone is going to look at you, do your hair better!"]],
  ["哇哦，我没见过你，你好吗？",["哇哦，我没见过你，你好吗？		Woah, I hadn't seen you, how are you?","我在飞机上看到了纽约，多么令人印象深刻！		I saw New York from the plane, how impressive!","现在她还记得她的家人，我不相信你！		And now she remembers her family, I don't believe you!","我在驾驶舱内没有看到任何飞行员。		I don't see any pilots in the cockpit.","虽然他们不会给你拍照，但你仍然可以做头发！		Although they won't take photos of you, you can still do your hair!","让我们倒数并开始聚会吧！		Let's count backwards and begin the party!","这么多人来看你的展览！		So many people came to your exhibit!","今晚来了这么多明星！		So many celebrities came tonight!","因为下雨所以很多人去看演出！		So many people went into the show because of the rain!","这么多知名嘉宾迟到了！		So many famous guests arrived late!","这么多记者问她同样的问题！		So many journalists asked her the same thing!","他说他不小心洒了！		He said he had spilled it by accident!","哇，这架飞机的服务太棒了！		Wow, the service on this airplane is fantastic!","哇，这家航空公司的制服好漂亮啊！		Wow, this airline's uniforms are very pretty!","哇，他们拍了我，我会出现在电视上！		Wow, they filmed me, and I'll appear on television!","他们在采访中开他的玩笑，可怜的人！		They were pulling his leg in the interview, poor man!","你不能穿着平角内裤离开家！		You can't leave the house in boxers!","我简直不敢相信这个头盔多么适合他！		I can't believe how the helmet fits him!","我不想认为他们是故意洒出来的！		I don't want to think that they spilled it on purpose!","当我到达博物馆时我不知道他们在拍摄！		I didn't know they were filming when I got to the museum!","好累啊，现在要靠窗的座位！		How tiring, now he wants the window seat!","太糟糕了，我们都看到了他的四角内裤！ 【[128]]总裁的发型好奇怪！		How awful, we all saw his boxers!","总裁的发型好奇怪啊！		The president's haircut is so strange!","只有儿童可以参观驾驶舱！		Only children can visit the cockpit!","她的发型一定是个意外！		Her haircut has to be an accident!","你是今天第八个告诉我这件事的人！		You're the eighth person today who has told me that!","政客真的是在后备箱里逃走的吗？		Did the politician really escape in the trunk?","他们真的让你坐在驾驶舱里吗？		Did they really let you sit in the cockpit?","你把酒洒在新娘的礼服上了？		You spilled wine on the bride's dress?","说真的，他是你的第八任丈夫？		Seriously, he's your eighth husband?","你真的不知道该说什么吗？		You seriously don't know what to say?","他们真的没有检查后备箱吗？		They seriously didn't check in the trunk?","你真的不会说什么吗？		You're seriously not going to say anything?","这是真的还是在开玩笑？		It is true or are you joking?","那个窗户在紧急出口吗？		Is that window in the emergency exit?","你在开我的玩笑吗？		Are you pulling my leg?","他们难道没有意识到自己在开玩笑吗？		Didn't they realize that they were pulling their leg?","他没有在镜子里看过自己的发型吗？		Hasn't he seen his haircut in a mirror?","为什么你们的平角内裤都是蓝色的？		Why are all your boxers blue?","你更喜欢过道而不是窗户吗？		Do you prefer the aisle instead of the window?"]],
  ["他那副表情想对你说什么？",["他那副表情想对你说什么？		What did he want to say to you with that look?","他睡觉时总是戴着头盔吗？		Does he always wear a helmet to sleep?","你认为开这样的玩笑合适吗？		Do you think it is appropriate to joke about something like this?","同一本小说他已经第八次给你了？		He gave you the same novel for the eighth time?","他们会拍摄你最后一首歌的视频吗？		Are they going to film the video of your last song?","一致看法		consensus","下学期我们要专门学习希腊哲学。		Next semester we will focus on studying Greek philosophy.","专业术语		technical terminology","个人价值观		personal values","主要理论		main theory","主要观点		main viewpoint","主要部分		main part","主要问题		main problem","人物性格		character's personality","人类起源		human origins","今天老师介绍了几位重要的人物。		Today the teacher introduced several important figures.","介绍术语		introducing terminology","传统价值观		traditional values","你昨天总算完成了艺术作业，对吗？		You finally finished your art homework yesterday, right?","你有没有兴趣以后去希腊旅行？		Are you interested in traveling to Greece in the future?","你能解释一下这句话的意义吗？		Can you explain the meaning of this sentence?","你觉得哪位同学的观点最清晰？		Which classmate's viewpoint do you think is the clearest?","你觉得哲学难学吗？		Do you think philosophy is hard to learn?","你觉得成为哲学家难不难？		Do you think becoming a philosopher is hard?","你觉得这位教授的逻辑清晰吗？		Do you think this professor's logic is clear?","你觉得这节课的内容清晰吗？		Do you think the content of this lesson is clear?","你选择的课程包含很多小组讨论，对吗？		The course you selected contains many group discussions, right?","信用很重要，因此我从不撒谎。		Trust is very important, so I never lie.","内容清晰		the content is clear","分析出结果		analysis yielded results","判断出重点		determine the key points","历史的起源		the origin of history","历史起源		historical origin","哲学作业难题		a tough philosophy homework problem","哲学家的观点		the philosopher's view","哲学老师让我们写一篇关于民主的文章。		The philosophy teacher had us write an essay about democracy.","哲学让我思考人生的意义。		Philosophy makes me ponder the meaning of life.","坚持价值观		uphold values","基本术语		basic terms","复杂术语		complex terminology"]],
  ["她尊重别人的时间，因此从不迟到。",["她尊重别人的时间，因此从不迟到。		She respects other people's time, so she is never late.","宗教的起源		the origin of religion","希腊哲学家		Greek philosophers","希腊艺术		Greek art","希腊艺术展		Greek art exhibition","形容一种观点		describe a point of view","形容不同看法		describe different opinions","形容感受		describe feelings","形容抽象现象		describe abstract phenomena","很有逻辑的老师		a very logical teacher","得出结论		draw a conclusion","态度一致		attitudes are consistent","想出办法		think of a way","想出方法		come up with a method","想出观点		come up with an opinion","我今天总算选到了我喜欢的课程。		Today I finally managed to select the courses that I like.","我们可以一起讨论那篇文章的结论。		We can discuss that article's conclusion together.","我们学校的科学课程包含实验和报告。		Our school's science curriculum includes experiments and reports.","我们昨天在哲学课上讨论了民主的重要性。		Yesterday in philosophy class, we discussed the importance of democracy.","我们走了半小时，总算到了图书馆。		We walked for half an hour, and finally arrived at the library.","我希望下学期的课程能包含更多实践活动。		I hope next semester's courses include more hands-on activities.","我很关注健康，因此每天都会运动。		I care a lot about my health, so I exercise every day.","我总算选到了喜欢的历史课。		I finally managed to sign up for a history class I like.","我的朋友对现代哲学家特别感兴趣。		My friend is particularly interested in modern philosophers.","我的看法和你们的不太一致。		My view is not quite the same as yours.","我觉得老师讲的话很有意义。		I think what the teacher said is very meaningful.","我认为结论和我们的观点不一致。		I think the conclusion is inconsistent with our views.","教授的结论		the professor's conclusion","文化起源		the origins of culture","新的术语		new terminology","昨天我读了一本关于民主发展的书。		Yesterday I read a book about the development of democracy.","昨天的作业对我来说太难懂了。		Yesterday's homework was too hard for me to understand.","智力游戏		puzzle games","智力表现		intellectual performance","有逻辑的表达		logical expression","有逻辑的讲解		logical explanation","朋友与同学		friends and classmates","术语解释		explanation of terms","梦想与努力		dreams and hard work","法国哲学家		French philosopher"]],
  ["现代哲学观点",["现代哲学观点		modern philosophical views","理解自己与理解别人一样重要。		Understanding oneself and understanding others are equally important.","理论起源		origin of theory","生活的意义		the meaning of life","结果一致		results are consistent","自由与责任		freedom and responsibility","表达清晰		expression is clear","西方哲学家		Western philosophers","西方哲学经典		classics of Western philosophy","讨论人物		discussion of characters","讨论意义		the significance of the discussion","重要的结论		important conclusion","难懂的理论		a hard-to-understand theory","下次再见！		See you next time.","朋友们，我们下次再见！		See you next time, friends!","再见，我要出发了。		Farewell, I'm taking off.","打开汽车前灯。		Turn on the car's headlights.","玩得开心，我们下次再见！		Have fun, and see you next time!","我们打电话给保险吧。		Let's call the insurance.","别笑了，打开车头灯！		Stop laughing and turn on the headlights!","在环岛处小心。		Careful at the roundabout.","小心，刹车！		Careful, brake!","祝这次长途旅行一切顺利。		Good luck with this long trip.","祝您的露营车冒险之旅好运。		Good luck with your adventure by campervan.","旅途愉快；当你到达时给我打电话！		Have a good trip; call me when you arrive!","祝您旅途愉快，别忘了给我们写信！		Have a good trip, and don't forget to write to us!","祝你旅途愉快，别太早回来！		Have a good trip, and don't come back too early!","旅​​途愉快，小心。		Have a good trip, and be careful.","保重，祝你好运！		Take care, and good luck!","小心，小心。		Take care, and be careful.","保重；见到你我很高兴！		Take care; I was thrilled to see you!","很快就到了开学第一天。		It's soon the first day of school.","这只是再见，不是告别。		It's just a goodbye, not a farewell.","这是一个环形交叉路口。		It's a roundabout.","这是一家租赁机构。		It's a rental agency.","这辆卡车不允许超越另一辆卡车。		This truck is not allowed to pass another one.","那不是方向盘；而是方向盘。这是轮子。		That isn't the steering wheel; it's the wheel.","他不是普通人。		He isn't just anyone.","这被子太热了。		This comforter is too hot.","这辆漂亮的露营车要多少钱？		How much does this wonderful campervan cost?"]],
  ["禁止在飞机上使用手机。",["禁止在飞机上使用手机。		No using one's cell phone on the plane.","禁止在泳池边跑步。		No running by the pool.","餐厅内禁止吸烟。		No smoking in the restaurant.","禁止在公园草坪上行走。		No walking on the park lawn.","在法国，暑假持续很长一段时间。		In France, summer break lasts for a long time.","终于放暑假了！		Finally, summer break!","关闭前灯。		Turn off the headlights.","备份时请注意。		Pay attention while backing up.","他向他亲爱的露营车告别了。		He said farewell to his dear campervan.","他经过了一辆自行车。		He passed a bike.","他今天早上上路了。		He got on the road this morning.","他开车碾压了他们的玩具，把它们全部压碎了。		He drove on their toys and crushed them all.","有时你必须考虑制动！		You sometimes must think about braking!","我们必须更换保险。		We must change insurances.","他甚至没有刹车。		He didn't even brake.","他住在马提尼克岛。		He lives in Martinique.","这个环岛发生了一起事故。		There was an accident at this roundabout.","他们正在马提尼克岛度过暑假。		They are spending the summer break in Martinique.","他们想在露台上吃晚饭！		They want to have dinner on the terrace!","我买了开学第一天的学习用品。		I bought the school supplies for the first day of school.","我刹车，但太晚了。		I braked, but too late.","我有一种感觉，这个车头灯不起作用。		I have a feeling that this headlight doesn't work.","想到这里我就热泪盈眶。		I have tears in my eyes when I think about it.","我的眼里含着泪水。		I have tears in my eyes.","由于床垫，我睡得很不好。		I slept badly because of the mattress.","我在床垫下发现了一百欧元！		I found a hundred euros under the mattress!","我讨厌休息区。		I hate rest areas.","我正停在禁止进入标志处。		I'm stopping at the do not enter sign.","我不会只和任何人开车离开。		I wouldn't leave by car with just anyone.","我无法备份。		I can't back up.","我梦想着在露台上喝一杯。		I was dreaming of having a drink on the terrace.","真的很抱歉毁了你的花。		I'm really sorry to have crushed your flowers.","租赁机构开放。		The rental agency is open.","休息区很拥挤。		The rest area was crowded.","保险包含在价格中吗？		The insurance is included in the price?","露营车在高速公路上抛锚了。		The campervan broke down on the highway.","我刹车时自行车刹车坏了。		The bike brake broke when I braked.","床垫太硬。		The mattress is too hard.","禁止进入标志是红色和圆形的。		The do not enter sign is red and round.","方向盘好小。		The steering wheel is so small."]]