  ["抱歉，我没有时间，所以我不看这本书。",["抱歉，我没有时间，所以我不看这本书。		Sorry, I don't have time, so I'm not reading the book.","抱歉，我没钱，所以我不去。		Sorry, I don't have money, so I won't go.","车坏了，所以我不去开会了。		The car broke down, so I won't go to the meeting.","车坏了，所以我上班迟到了。		The car broke down, so I was late for work.","我无法查看消息，因为我的计算机坏了。		I can't check messages because my computer is broken.","圣诞晚会的地点是敏俊家？		The location of the Christmas party is Minjoon's house?","出租车很贵，所以我不常坐。		Taxi is expensive, so I don't take it often.","周六我很忙，所以我不能去山上。		I'll be busy on Saturday, so I won't be able to go to the mountains.","聚会地点太远了，我就不去了。		The party location is too far away, so I won't go.","敏君先生在机场遇到了一位小学朋友。		Mr. Minjun met a friend from elementary school at the airport.","宝拉，你最近点的菜多吗？		Bora, have you ordered a lot of food recently?","Bora，你在小学认识过朋友吗？		Bora, did you meet a friend in elementary school?","你刚刚点了炒年糕和紫菜包饭吗？		Did you just order teokboki and kimbap?","您最近订购过 manti 和 chapcha 吗？		Have you ordered manti and chapcha recently?","安娜，你还没收到菜单吗？		Anna, haven't you received the menu yet?","安娜的小学朋友在哪里？		Where is Anna's friend from elementary school?","我把支票和货物一起交给你了。		I handed you the check and the goods together.","找了好久才找到一家不错的餐厅。		I found a good restaurant after a long time.","好久没来这家店了。		I came to this store after a long time.","时隔很长一段时间，我去了一家大咖啡馆。		I visited a large cafe after a long time.","Minjoon和我刚刚收到了Kalbitan。		Minjoon and I just received Kalbitan.","我和妹妹吃得很快！		Me and my little sister ate very quickly!","小学旁边有一家好吃的餐馆。		There is a delicious restaurant next to the elementary school.","当我上小学时，我经常去图书馆。		When I was in elementary school, I often went to the library.","韩国餐厅的饭菜还是热乎乎的。		The food at the Korean restaurant is still warm.","我和弟弟最近通了电话。		My younger brother and I recently spoke on the phone.","珉俊，你和你弟弟通电话了吗？		Minjoon, did you talk to your little brother on the phone?","你的胳膊和腿现在也完全痊愈了吗？		Are your arms and legs also completely healed now?","手臂和头部现在真的完全痊愈了吗？		Are the arm and head really completely healed now?","安娜，你给你父母打电话了吗？		Anna, did you call your parents?","唉，怎么办啊，我和妹妹都错了！		Oh, what should I do, my younger sister and I made a mistake!","怎么办，我们犯了错误？		What to do, we made a mistake?","怎么办，我和父母都错了！		What to do, my parents and I made a mistake!","我和安娜一起担心！		I was worried along with Anna!","现在我真的没有任何担心了。		Now I really don't have any worries.","小学时，我经常在街上摔倒。		In elementary school, I often fell in the street.","我最近和一位朋友通了电话。		I recently spoke on the phone with a friend.","我和我妹妹的手有点受伤。		Me and my little sister hurt our hands a little.","确实，不用担心！		Indeed, there are no worries!","一位朋友的哥哥最近离开了。		A friend's older brother recently left."]],
  ["水和勺子也已经拿来了！",["水和勺子也已经拿来了！		Water and a spoon have already been brought too!","主人，也给我一个勺子吧。		Master, please give me a spoon too.","明天我会去看比赛。		Tomorrow I'll go watch the race.","明天我将去看奥运会足球比赛。		Tomorrow I will go to the Olympic football match.","明天两点三十分有一场乒乓球比赛。		Tomorrow there is a table tennis match at two thirty.","明天我将观看韩国运动员的比赛。		Tomorrow I will watch the race of a Korean athlete.","下一场比赛是周二十点？		Next match is Tuesday at ten o'clock?","此前，乒乓球比赛是在两点三十分。		Previously, the table tennis match was at two thirty.","你不久前看过乒乓球吗？		Have you seen ping pong a while ago?","怎么办，已经六点半了！		What to do, it’s already half past six!","你喜欢奥运会的哪些比赛？		What competitions do you like at the Olympics?","这些奥运会将在法国举行。		These Olympic Games will be held in France.","我一定会观看这些奥运会。		I will definitely watch these Olympic Games.","我会在家看这场网球比赛。		I will watch this tennis match at home.","日本棒球队的比赛是在三点半。		The Japanese baseball team's game was at half past three.","日本棒球队五点比赛了！		The Japanese baseball team was playing at five o'clock!","现在我正在观看一位法国运动员和朋友一起跑步。		Now I'm watching a French athlete run with a friend.","电视坏了，看不了乒乓球了！		The TV broke and I couldn't watch table tennis!","韩国乒乓球队的比赛是几点？		What time was the Korean table tennis team's game?","我刚买了一支白铅笔和钢笔！		I just bought a white pencil and pen!","宝拉下周不是有外语考试吗？		Doesn't Bora have a foreign language exam next week?","您更喜欢哪个图书馆？		Which library do you prefer?","我今天要参加词汇测试！		I'm going to take the vocabulary test today!","Peter，请借我一本韩语课本和一份报纸！		Peter, please lend me a Korean textbook and a newspaper!","你和你的兄弟姐妹一起说话吗？		Did you talk to your brother and sister together?","冬天很少下雪。		There is little snow in winter.","冬天，冰甜品吃得比蛋糕少。		In winter, ice dessert is eaten less than cake.","这棵树不太漂亮。		The tree is less beautiful.","天气冷，多吃些温热的食物吧！		The weather is cold, so I eat more warm food!","明天的天空会比今天更美丽。		Tomorrow the sky will be more beautiful than today.","由于大风，我的伞坏了！		Due to the strong wind, my umbrella broke!","因为下雨，山很难看清。		Because of the rain, the mountains are hard to see.","爸爸昨天去餐馆吃参鸡汤。		Dad went to a restaurant to eat samgyetang yesterday.","秋天怎么也热啊！		How come it’s hot in autumn too!","这里冬天通常会下雪。		It usually snows here in winter.","今天下午我要和朋友一起喝咖啡。		I'm going to have coffee with a friend this afternoon.","今天的风比周六更强。		The wind is blowing stronger today than on Saturday.","午餐后，风会比早上更强。		After lunch the wind will blow stronger than in the morning.","白天的降雨量会比早上多。		There will be more rain during the day than in the morning.","今年秋天的夜晚比去年冷多了。		This fall the nights are less cold than last year."]],
  ["今年的秋天比去年少了一些凉意。",["今年的秋天比去年少了一些凉意。		This year the autumn is less cool compared to last year.","今年冬天看到的动物越来越少。		Fewer animals are seen this winter.","今年冬天的雪比去年少。		There is less snow this winter than last year.","今年的树木不如去年漂亮。		This year the trees are less beautiful than last year.","今年的雪确实很大。		There really was a lot of snow this year.","今年有很多炎热的日子。		There have been a lot of hot days this year.","今年的雪比去年少了。		It's snowing less this year than last year.","最近的降雨量比去年更多。		There has been more rain lately than last year.","去年秋天的天气怎么样？		What was the weather like last fall?","看看那棵树上的动物！		Look at the animal in that tree!","我儿子感冒了，我给他吃点药。		My son has a cold, so I will give him some medicine.","这个人制作了韩国最好的卡尔比坦。		This man makes the best kalbitan in Korea.","这位球员是高中球员中最好的。		This player is the best among high school players.","首尔这家餐厅做的烤肉最好吃？		This restaurant in Seoul makes the best bulgogi?","我在这家咖啡馆喝了咖啡。		I drank coffee in this cafe.","这个学生是高中生中最高的。		This student is the tallest among the high school students.","这个学生是最著名的足球运动员。		This student is the most famous of the football players.","当然，博物馆是所有建筑中最酷的。		Of course, the museum is the coolest building of all.","安娜，一年四季中你最喜欢冬天吗？		Anna, do you like winter most of all the seasons?","这个地方是最美的。		This place is the most beautiful.","我是我们家里最好的滑雪者。		I'm the best skier in our family.","这场表演是所有表演中最有趣的。		This performance is the most interesting of all.","在女演员中，我最喜欢这个女演员。		Among the actresses, I like this actress the most.","这个人是滑雪者中速度最快的。		This man is the fastest among skiers.","这个人韩语是外国演员中说得最好的。		This person speaks Korean best among the foreign actors.","这个人的厨艺比厨师中任何人都好。		This man cooks better than anyone else among the chefs.","这位高中生是运动员中跑得最快的吗？		Is this high school student the fastest among athletes?","这位高中生是运动员中最年轻的。		This high school student is the youngest among the athletes.","那趟火车真长！		That train is really long!","此菜肴不能在微波炉中重新加热。		This dish cannot be reheated in the microwave.","你应该将空可乐瓶扔进哪个垃圾桶？		Which trash can should you throw an empty cola bottle into?","一大早便利店里人很少。		There are few people in the convenience store early in the morning.","现在是凌晨，现在几点了？		It's early morning, what time is it?","我在便利店买了一份夜宵。		I bought a late-night snack at a convenience store.","我正在便利店寻找夜宵。		I'm looking for a late-night snack at a convenience store.","我们去河上划船好吗？		Shall we go boating on the river?","我要去旅行看看这条河。		I will go on a trip to look at the river.","虽然旅程结束了，但它仍然留在记忆中。		Although the journey is over, it remains in the memory.","四天旅程的准备工作已经完成。		Preparations for the four-day journey have been completed.","我要陪我的父母去探索马来西亚的市场。		I am going to accompany my parents and explore the markets of Malaysia."]],
  ["该应用程序使预订酒店变得容易。",["该应用程序使预订酒店变得容易。		The app made booking a hotel easy.","我们爬的山上有一座佛寺。		On the mountain we climbed there was a Buddhist temple.","当我们到达时，我们将陪我父亲一起吃午饭。		When we arrive, we will accompany my father and have lunch.","我们将参观山区美丽的旅游景点。		We will visit beautiful tourist attractions in the mountains.","多亏了地图，困难的路径不再是问题。		Thanks to the map, difficult paths were not a concern.","收拾好行李后，我就要开始旅程了。		After I unpack my things, I will begin the journey.","到达酒店后，我要去游泳。		After I arrive at the hotel, I will go swimming.","别担心，用牙刷彻底刷牙。		Don't worry and brush your teeth thoroughly with a toothbrush.","那里有一张桌子。		There's a table there.","我很高兴你是我的好朋友。		I'm glad you're my good friend.","奇亚，谢谢你		Chia, thank you","吉亚，看这里		Gia, look here","如果它们是相同的东西，则无需更改它们。		If they are the same things, there is no need to change them.","你找到同样尺码的裤子了吗？		Did you find the same size pants?","那是一个美丽的地方。		It was a beautiful place.","这是我爸爸正在看的电影的标题。		That was the title of the movie my dad was watching.","爸爸妈妈也想过一百万韩元的总数吗？		Mom and Dad also thought about the sum of a million won?","你看过这部电影吗？		Have you seen the movie?","那里一定有一个方便的地方。		There must be a convenient place there.","肉汤太美味了，让我很惊讶。		The broth was so tasty that I was very surprised.","可能不是辛辣的食物。		Probably not spicy food.","当天会有一两个特别活动！		There will be one or two special events that day!","两年后，我们会一起跳舞吗？		In two years, will we all dance together?","你大邱的朋友们也会来吗？		Will all your friends from Daegu come too?","如果大邱的朋友来的话就更开心了。		If friends from Daegu come, it will be even more fun.","每个人都会来。		Everyone will come.","好久不见，很高兴见到你。		It was nice to see you after a long time!","两年后举办一场大型聚会怎么样？		How about a big party in two years?","第一次尝试这么美味的汤！		This is my first time trying such a delicious soup!","这种纪念活动是第一次举办吗？		Is this the first time this commemorative event has been held?","这次会议的地点是一家日本餐厅。		The place for this meeting is a Japanese restaurant.","日本餐厅的食物可能不错。		A Japanese restaurant probably has good food.","如果大家都不能来的话，那就太可惜了。		If everyone can't come, it will be a shame.","蛋糕会很大。		The cake will be very big.","很多大邱的朋友都会从学校来。		Many friends from Daegu will come from school.","哪怕来一两个人也没关系。		Even if one or two people come, that's okay.","我应该再邀请一两个人吗？		Should I invite one or two more people?","结果不正确		The result is incorrect","计算不正确		Calculation is incorrect","眼睛红了		Eyes are red"]],
  ["甜蜜的味道留在记忆中很长一段时间。",["甜蜜的味道留在记忆中很长一段时间。		The sweet taste remains in the memory for a long time.","拔出来会更痛。		It will hurt more if you pull it out.","禁止咀嚼。		No chewing.","不要使用太多牙膏。		Don't use too much toothpaste.","不要随意选择牙膏。		Don't choose your toothpaste carelessly.","当我见到家人时我会感到紧张。		I get nervous when I meet my family.","抬起头。		Raise your head.","我鞠躬问候		I bow in greeting","抬起头来听我的故事。		Raise your head and listen to my story.","我第一次被教握手是在小学。		I was first taught to shake hands in elementary school.","昨天我和一个朋友见面很开心。		Yesterday I had fun when I met up with a friend.","第一次见面我就打招呼。		I say hello well when I first meet.","乘汽车旅行时，请系好安全带。		When traveling by car, wear your seat belt.","当我们第一次见面时，我们会说出我们的名字。		When we first meet, we say our names.","当我第一次上学时我很担心。		I was worried when I first went to school.","您需要选择邀请函设计。		You need to choose an invitation design.","见到朋友时，我会低下头。		When meeting a friend, I bow my head.","你第一次上学时感觉如何？		How did you feel when you first went to school?","这个邻居看起来很陌生，所以我和他说话不多。		This neighbor seems unfamiliar, so I don't talk to him much.","即使在街上，他也用帽子遮住脸。		He covers his face with a hat even on the street.","他在今天的公司聚会上表现如何？		How did he behave at today's corporate party?","邻居戴上帽子遮住眼睛。		The neighbor puts on a hat and shades his eyes.","你看起来很忙，工作量很大。		You look very busy with so much work.","我经常在朋友面前隐藏自己的脸。		I often hide my face in front of my friends.","公司晚宴期间我很友好。		I was friendly during the company dinner.","在休息室我是第一个打招呼的。		In the break room I was the first to say hello.","这家公司出口量很大。		This company exports a lot.","适合目的		Fit for purpose","10月份需要做什么准备？		What preparations are needed for October?","是的，所有员工的努力确实非常重要。		Yes, the efforts of all employees were indeed very important.","是的，我们在新市场上特别成功。		Yes, we have been particularly successful in new markets.","在今天的会议之前您需要吸尘器吗？		Do you need a vacuum cleaner before today's meeting?","我很高兴公司表现良好。		I'm glad the company is doing well.","主任，要我陪你去医院吗？		Director, do you want me to go with you to the hospital?","比赛结束后，我们应该和朋友一起去市中心散步吗？		After the game, should we take a walk around the city center with a friend?","我计划在下一场比赛中穿这套队服。		I plan to wear the uniform for the next game.","每天我都会换上制服并训练。		Every day I change into my uniform and train.","我从学长那里学会了如何准备考试。		I learned how to prepare for exams from a senior.","老师问了我很多问题。		The teacher asks me a lot of questions.","训练结束后，我脱掉衣服并继续穿着。		After training, I take off my clothes and leave them on."]],
  ["今天我要复习考试笔记。",["今天我要复习考试笔记。		Today I'm going to revise my notes for the exam.","下一场比赛我也会穿短裤。		I'm also going to wear shorts for the next game.","毕业后，我会刻苦训练足球。		After graduation, I will train hard in football.","我只是简单地告诉我的朋友这个计划。		I just briefly told my friends about the plan.","让我们和朋友重复一遍吗？		Let's repeat it with a friend?","我正准备去法国旅行。		I was just preparing a trip to France.","我经常听广播来准备法语考试。		I often listen to the radio to prepare for my French exam.","只剩下几道菜了。		Only a few dishes left.","菜单上仅剩一项。		Only one item left on the menu.","我只能选择一种或两种食物。		I can only choose one or two types of food.","挺贵的，但是味道不是很好。		Quite expensive, but the taste is not very good.","我会寻找另一个菜单。		I'll look for another menu.","我会再找一家餐馆。		I'll find another restaurant.","我饿了，所以我想去别的地方。		I'm hungry, so I want to go somewhere else.","服务很差，我很快就离开了。		The service was poor and I quickly left.","在底部，咖啡已经完全漏出。		At the bottom, the coffee has completely leaked out.","我有点失望，因为牛奶是冷的。		I was a little disappointed because the milk was cold.","我去过很多地方，但这里的服务很差。		I have visited various places, but the service here is poor.","我很混乱，犯了一个错误。		I was in turmoil and made a mistake.","这绝对不是我喜欢的食物。		This is definitely not my kind of food.","钱不够		Not enough money","金额较大		The amount is large","如果建一个火车站，交通会不会变得更方便？		If we build a train station, will transportation become more convenient?","大邱东部需要火车站吗？		Is a train station needed in eastern Daegu?","市民表示东部需要一座新车站。		Citizens said that a new station was needed in the east.","强烈抵抗		Strong resistance","市民想要东部火车站吗？		Do citizens want an eastern train station?","这里有一个运动场，对吗？		There's a sports ground here, right?","我想知道为什么我们有不同的意见。		I'm wondering why we have different opinions.","我有意见		I have an opinion","意见很重要		Opinion matters","他是一名新生，但在所有考试中都取得了好成绩。		He is a new student, but got good marks in all his exams.","他话不多，但表现很好。		He spoke little, but performed well.","是什么原因让您领奖颠倒？		For what reason did you receive the award upside down?","我没有获奖，但我真的很尊重你。		I didn't win the award, but I really respect you.","我很高兴收到我的文凭。		I am very pleased to receive my diploma.","我的作业做得很好，但得分很低。		I did my homework well, but got a low score.","我考试成绩很好，但结果让我很沮丧。		I did well in the exam, but the result upsets me.","我们几乎没有训练，但我们做得很好。		We hardly trained, but we did very well.","我有点紧张，但最后一切都很顺利。		I was a little nervous, but in the end everything went well."]],
  ["好的考试成绩当然是值得祝贺的。",["好的考试成绩当然是值得祝贺的。		Good exam results are, of course, a cause for congratulations.","第一节课考试成绩优秀。		The results of the first lesson exam were excellent.","尽管我没有被邀请，但我还是获得了奖项。		I was given an award even though I was not invited.","因为我利用业余时间学习，所以我取得了成功。		Because I studied in my free time, I became successful.","我通过在空闲时间付出努力而取得了成功。		I achieved success by putting in effort in my free time.","你可以通过面部表情来判断你的心情。		You can tell your mood by facial expressions.","课程结束时，我收到了一份成绩单。		At the end of the lesson I received a report card.","在我的梦中，我正在购物。		In my dream I was shopping.","我叔叔关于他的梦想的故事非常有趣。		My uncle's story about his dream is very interesting.","叔叔因为Sollongtan汤而毁了他的衣服。		Uncle ruined his clothes because of the Sollongtan broth.","我叔叔非常喜欢嫩豆腐汤，每周都会吃。		My uncle loves soft tofu soup so much that he eats it every week.","等叔叔醒了，我就去百货公司。		After uncle wakes up, I'll go to the department store.","叔叔睡了之后我们去逛街吧？		Shall we go shopping after uncle sleeps?","新裤子的臀部区域非常耐用。		The new pants were very durable in the buttocks area.","我买了一条新裤子，但裤子上有一个洞。		I bought new trousers, but there was a hole in them.","没有洗衣粉，洗衣服就不好。		Without washing powder, washing does not go well.","我去买了一瓶巴掌大的洗洁精。		I went to buy a palm-sized bottle of detergent.","我们去了一个滑雪胜地，一切都出了问题。		We went to a ski resort and everything went wrong.","体育用品商店目前有折扣。		There are currently discounts at the sports store.","叔叔睡着后我们去买衣服。		We went to buy clothes after my uncle fell asleep.","我正在互联网上查找有关折扣的信息。		I'm looking for information about discounts on the Internet.","我试穿了T恤并检查了我的风格。		I tried on the T-shirt and checked my style.","我用退回的钱买了新衣服。		I bought new clothes with the money that was returned.","让我们从内心深处谈起。		Let's talk outside from the heart.","巷子里的商店		Shop in an alley","当你打扫巷子时，会发现有很多垃圾。		When you sweep an alley, there is a lot of garbage.","那个标志		that sign","大城市中标牌的组织很重要。		The organization of signage in megacities is important.","如果面积较大，清洁时间会较长。		If the area is large, cleaning will take a long time.","等大家自由发表意见后，我们才会做出决定。		After everyone has freely expressed their opinions, we will make a decision.","首先，年轻人的思想很重要。		First of all, the thoughts of young people are important.","很多变化		a lot of changes","用扫帚从心扫。		Sweep with a broom from the heart.","彻底清洁后您感觉如何？		How do you feel after a good cleaning?","如果我彻底清理干净，邻居会怎么想？		What will the neighbors think if I clean it thoroughly?","你能随心所欲地清理吗？		Can you clean up as you wish?","你可以用这把扫帚全心全意地扫地。		You can sweep with all your heart with this broom.","我可以自己做吗？		Can I do this on my own?","我喜欢这个标志正面的颜色。		I love the color of the front of this sign.","我彻底清洁了这个标志的正面。		I thoroughly cleaned the front of this sign."]],
  ["也许这次我们会开始清理最广泛的区域？",["也许这次我们会开始清理最广泛的区域？		Maybe this time we'll start cleaning up the widest areas?","你认为邻居会拿割草机吗？		Do you think the neighbors will take the lawnmower?","清洁真的很难。		Cleaning is really hard.","标志如此干净真是太棒了。		It's great that the sign is so clean.","如果我去保安室，我能得到邻居的联系方式吗？		If I go to the security room, will I be able to get my neighbors' contact information?","老师很和蔼，所以很受欢迎。		The teacher is kind, so he is very popular.","我想和老师交换联系方式。		I want to exchange contact information with the teacher.","由于头痛，我无法帮助邻居。		Because of the headache, I couldn't help my neighbor.","洗完澡放松一下真好。		It's nice to relax after taking a bath.","你可以去澡堂和你的邻居见面。		You can go down to the bathhouse and meet your neighbors.","我们家有桑拿房，很方便。		There is a sauna in our house, so it is convenient.","我身体剧烈疼痛，邻居给我送来了药。		I have severe body aches, and a neighbor brought me medicine.","下到门口		Go down to the door","我想道歉，所以我给了她年糕。		I wanted to apologize, so I gave her rice cakes.","我喜欢新房子有一个浴室。		I like that the new house has a bathhouse.","新邻居搬来和我们一起住——一男一女。		New neighbors moved in with us - a man and a woman.","我很高兴我把衣服带到了干洗店。		I'm glad I took my clothes to the dry cleaner.","我要去干洗店洗衣服然后去澡堂。		I'm going to take my clothes to the dry cleaner and go to the bathhouse.","感谢叔叔，我们搬行李的速度更快了。		Thanks to my uncle, we moved our luggage faster.","我邀请一位朋友参加我老邻居的一个节日。		I invited a friend to a festival in my old neighborhood.","搬家后，我想休息一下。		After moving, I want to rest a little.","搬完后，我前往地下澡堂。		Having finished moving, I head to the underground bathhouse.","因为搬家的事，我向那人解释了。		Because of the move, I explained to the man.","我想与邻居老师交换联系信息。		I would like to exchange contact information with a neighbor teacher.","邻居，一男一女，来我们家打招呼。		Neighbors, a man and a woman, came to say hello to our house.","我要从陈列室购买这件作品。		I'm going to buy this piece from the showroom.","我在展览周围走来走去看看这些画。		I walked around the exhibition to look at the paintings.","我是来看画展的。		I come to the exhibition to look at the paintings.","我感兴趣是因为我听关于艺术的故事。		I'm interested because I listen to stories about art.","这首曲子我最喜欢的是它的长度。		My favorite thing about this piece is the length.","我喜欢这个作品。		I like this piece.","我想看看这位艺术家的其他画作。		I want to see other paintings by this artist.","展厅里的作品太多了，腿都酸了。		There are so many works in the exhibition hall that my legs hurt.","展览很大，所以需要很多时间。		The exhibition is large, so it takes a lot of time.","我很开心，因为我正在和朋友聊天。		I'm having fun because I'm talking to a friend.","八十幅画中，我最喜欢这一幅。		Of the eighty paintings, I like this one the most.","无论问多少次，我都不知道答案。		No matter how many times I ask, I don't know the answer.","无论我读多少，这本书都很难。		No matter how much I read, this book is very difficult.","这些水果的皮可以吃吗？		Is it possible to eat the peel of these fruits?","这次旅行需要一个技术团队。		A technical team is needed for this trip."]],
  ["今天我们有一个公司聚会。",["今天我们有一个公司聚会。		Today we have a corporate party.","此行需要技术团队吗？		Is a technical team needed for this trip?","让我们更多地讨论下个月的计划。		Let's talk more about plans for the next month.","巴西下个月的天气怎么样？		What will the weather be like in Brazil next month?","我坐下来。		I sit down.","有重要信息吗？		Is there important information?","在会议上我将介绍出口计划。		At the meeting I will be making a presentation on the export plan.","请推荐下一次聚会的地点。		Please recommend a place for the next after party.","意义很重要		Meaning is important","这次余兴聚会的地点很合适。		The location for the after party was appropriate this time.","这周您会去蔚山出差吗？		Will you be going on a business trip to Ulsan this week?","现在有更多选择。		Now there are more options.","在日本餐厅举办公司晚宴怎么样？		How about a corporate dinner at a Japanese restaurant?","上周的会议是什么时候？		What time was the meeting last week?","我会学习。		I will study.","您也可以自由参加课程。		You are also free to attend the lesson.","请提供有关下次考试的详细信息。		Please give details about the next exam.","享受大学生活也是新生的目标。		Enjoying college life is also a freshman's goal.","尝试围绕您的新目标进行安排。		Try scheduling around your new goal.","作为初学者，请尝试持续努力。		As a beginner, try to put in consistent effort.","我想要获得勇气		I want to gain courage","我会鼓起勇气准备一份报告。		I will gather my courage and prepare a report.","我有很多事情要做，而且很难。		I have a lot to do and it's hard.","所以，我推荐这学期的这些科目。		So, I recommend these subjects for this semester.","我会鼓起勇气做一个演讲。		I will gather my courage and give a presentation.","为了您的健康，请做好与对手的比赛准备。		For the sake of your health, prepare for your match with your opponent.","这位朋友可能也想一起去。		This friend probably also wants to go along.","我能处理好		I can handle it well","如果你经常笑你会开心吗？		Will you be happy if you laugh a lot?","如果你运动时输了怎么办？		What do you do if you lose when you play sports?","这个习惯可能对您的健康有益。		This habit is probably good for your health.","现在尝试向相反方向施加力。		Now try applying force in the opposite direction.","如果你做这样的运动，那是很累的。		If you play sports like this, it is very tiring.","如果你把自己逼得太紧，那是很危险的。		If you push yourself so hard, it's dangerous.","即使打开暖气我也感觉冷。		I feel cold even when I turn on the heater.","天气好转了，我们应该去公园吗？		The weather has improved, maybe we should go to the park?","明天天气晴朗，不会是多云。		Tomorrow will be fine because it won't be cloudy.","我不怕风，也不怕雨。		I am not afraid of either wind or rain.","三个团队已经开始进行修复工作。		Three teams are already working on repairs.","由于修复，电力很快就会恢复。		Thanks to repairs, electricity will soon return."]],
  ["这里还有很多玻璃瓶。",["这里还有很多玻璃瓶。		There are also a lot of glass bottles here.","尽管气温低于零度，仍有多达一百人前来。		Despite the sub-zero temperature, as many as one hundred people came.","最近天气很冷，但来的人却有上百人之多。		The weather has been cold lately, but as many as a hundred people came.","我没想到会出现任何偏差。		I did not expect any deviations to appear.","网络中断了整整两个小时！		The Internet was interrupted for two whole hours!","四扇窗户被打破，很危险。		Four windows are broken, it's dangerous.","杯面只剩下几张了。		There are only a few cup noodles left.","杯子里的方便面已经所剩无几了。		There are not many instant noodles left in the cup.","我们去散步吧，因为阳光明媚。		Let's go for a walk, because the sun is shining.","准备钓鱼时选择一根不会折断的鱼竿。		Choose a fishing rod that won't break when preparing to go fishing.","少年第一次尝试在海里钓鱼。		Junior tries to fish in the sea for the first time.","如果您出现严重晕动病，请打开窗户。		If you experience severe motion sickness, open the window.","登船时，请小心放置行李。		When boarding the ship, carefully place your bag.","早餐后我们就出发。		We'll go after breakfast.","早餐后我们离开。		We leave after breakfast.","如果你好好听渔夫的话，准备工作就会成功。		If you listen well to the fisherman, the preparation will be successful.","我可以在这个包里放钓鱼竿吗？		Can I put a fishing rod in this bag?","你应该把钓鱼线放在这个盒子里吗？		Should you put fishing line in this box?","如果你不穿胶靴，你的脚会湿的。		If you don't wear rubber boots, your feet will get wet.","准备完毕，出发吧。		Having completed your preparations, go.","看了地图后，我寻找道路。		After looking at the map, I look for the road.","大鱼咬钩就困难了。		If a big fish bites, it will be difficult.","我想知道你买那块手表有多久了。		I'm wondering how long it's been since you bought that watch.","我很享受和祖母在大田度过的时光。		I enjoy the time I spent with my grandmother in Daejeon.","随着膝盖的好转，奶奶的笑容也越来越多。		As her knee gets better, Grandma smiles more often.","那是很久以前的事了。		It was a long time ago.","哎呀，你一定玩得很开心吧。		Aigo, you must have had a very good time.","我五分钟前刚坐下。		I sat down just five minutes ago.","我现在正在去探望我的父亲亲戚的路上。		I am now on my way to visit my paternal relatives.","我要去拜访我的父家。		I'm going to visit my paternal family.","我经常和朋友见面，我们变得很亲密。		I often met with friends and we became close.","当我第一次开始学习半茶时，我遇到了困难。		I had difficulty when I first started learning hancha.","爷爷的朋友们都老了，和以前不一样了。		Grandfather's friends have grown old and are not the same as before.","祖父在北方的一所大学读书。		Grandfather studied at a university in the north.","我想听听祖父讲述他的北方生活的故事。		I want to listen to my grandfather's stories about his northern life.","我想听听爷爷讲他的留学故事。		I want to listen to my grandfather’s story about his studies abroad.","我们一起去动物园还是在家看电影？		Shall we go to the zoo together or watch a movie at home?","想在公园散步或骑自行车吗？		Want to take a walk or bike ride in the park?","我会在图书馆学习或在咖啡馆放松。		I will study in the library or relax in a cafe.","你想跑去动物园参加会议吗？		Do you want to run to the meeting at the zoo and join?"]],
  ["买票还是改天去？",["买票还是改天去？		Buy a ticket or go another day?","周末我想照顾动物。		On weekends I want to take care of animals.","周末我会做志愿者工作或与家人共度时光。		On the weekends I will do volunteer work or spend time with my family.","您可以像以前一样组织演讲节目。		You can organize the speech program as before.","表演服装需要额外收费吗？		Will there be an additional charge for the performance costume?","也许我们可以一起换衣服？		Maybe we can all change clothes together?","我在舞台上跑得太多，以至于我上气不接下气。		I was running so much on stage that I was out of breath.","回报老师		return to the teacher","你想穿什么衣服？		What outfit do you want to wear?","衣服颜色鲜艳，就像电影里的男主角一样。		The clothes are bright, like the hero of the film.","衣服缩水了，这是个大问题。		Clothes have shrunk, and this is a big problem.","这次才艺大赛你准备呈现什么样的表演？		What kind of performance are you planning for this talent competition?","嘴唇颤抖		Lips tremble","演员金是一个薄唇的男人。		Actor Kim is a man with thin lips.","我有一些我不能穿的衣服。		I've got clothes that I can't wear.","由于服装错误，演出陷入危险。		The performance is in danger due to the wrong costume.","感谢和我一起运动的朋友，我玩得很开心。		Thanks to the friends I play sports with, I have fun.","你需要一个朋友一起运动吗？		Do you need a friend to play sports with?","在他们扔球的地方见我。		Meet me where they throw the ball.","他是一名击球技术出色的球员。		He is a player with good ball-striking technique.","击球的球员就在我的正前方。		The player who hit the ball is directly in front of me.","如果您想放松肌肉，请尝试此练习。		If you want to relax your muscles, try this exercise.","下次我们能进球吗？		Shall we score a goal next time?","我想在跑步的地方休息。		I want to rest where I run.","当你上三年级时，你将能够参加更多比赛。		When you're in third grade, you'll be able to take part in more matches.","经常训练的队伍才是强大的。		A team that trains a lot is strong.","在你训练的地方跑步，一模一样。		Run where you trained, exactly the same.","今天我们团队努力工作，没有被训斥。		Our team worked hard today and was not reprimanded.","和热爱运动的朋友一起锻炼。		Exercise with a friend who loves sports.","获胜的球队下次对阵更强的球队。		The winning team plays the stronger team next time.","虽然还早，但我正在为了团队而努力。		Although it's early, I'm trying for the sake of the team.","我不喜欢清晨锻炼。		I don't like early morning workouts.","晚上我想休息。		I want to rest in the evening.","最好的球员来自全国各地。		The best players come from all over the country.","通过上课，有更多的实践机会。		By attending classes, there are more opportunities for practice.","网球场旁边有一个运动场。		There is a sports ground next to the tennis court.","秘密选择。		Select secretly.","购物中心里有哪些衣服？		What kind of clothes are there in the shopping center?","一起买鞋就好了。		It would be nice to buy shoes together.","这家店的顾客比较多。		There are more customers in this store."]],
  ["然后他在同一个地方工作了三十年。",["然后他在同一个地方工作了三十年。		Then he worked in the same place for thirty years.","歌曲刚结束，蛋糕就到了。		Just as the song ended, the cake arrived.","只有朋友也能来参加聚会。		Just friends were also able to come to the party.","由于讲话的非正式性，气氛变得更加轻松。		Due to the informal speech, the atmosphere became more relaxed.","宝拉在公公身边学会了做年糕。		Bora learned to make rice cakes next to her father-in-law.","宝拉在公公旁边说了很多话。		Bora talked a lot next to her father-in-law.","宝拉和她丈夫的父亲一起去了景福宫。		Bora went to Gyeongbokgung with her husband's father.","宝拉和她的公公在景福宫度过了愉快的时光。		Bora and her father-in-law enjoyed their time at Gyeongbokgung Palace.","我记得很清楚		I remember exactly","感谢我的父亲，聚会变得更加愉快。		Thanks to my father, the party became more enjoyable.","父亲的生日		Father's birthday","我父亲的生日蛋糕刚到。		A cake just arrived for my father's birthday.","我父亲年轻时就喜欢音乐。 [[183]​​] 我父亲发现这只小狗很可爱。		My father loved music when he was young.","我很惊讶，因为蜡烛太多了。		I was surprised because there were too many candles.","蜡烛在蛋糕上。		The candle was on the cake.","我还认识了一个朋友。		I also met a friend.","孙子吹灭了蛋糕上的所有蜡烛。		The grandson blew out all the candles on the cake.","在聚会上，我和父亲拍了一张照片。		At the party, I took a photo with my father.","祖母的形象浮现		The image of a grandmother emerges","因为这直发，我在家庭聚会上受到了称赞。		Because of this straight hair, I received compliments at a family gathering.","外观精致		Its appearance is exquisite","邻居们因为这对双胞胎的善良而喜爱他们。		The neighbors loved the twins for their kindness.","心地善良的人朋友很多。		A person with a good heart has many friends.","所有的家庭都记得博拉是如何拥有直发的。		All families remember how Bora had straight hair.","宝拉仔细打理着她的直发。		Bora carefully took care of her straight hair.","看到Bora的长发让我总是嫉妒。		Seeing Bora's long hair made me always jealous.","这对双胞胎看起来很相似。		The twins looked alike.","无缘无故地吠叫		Barking for no reason","我和同事相处不好。		I couldn't get along well with my colleague.","高双胞胎		Tall Twins","朋友站在煤气灶前		friend standing in front of a gas stove","和你在一起对我来说很容易，因为我们很合适。		It's easy for me to be with you because we suit each other well.","如果两个人有相同的爱好，他们就能玩得更开心。		If two people have the same hobbies, they can have more fun.","每天早上我都会从鞋柜里拿出鞋子。		Every morning I take my shoes out of the shoe closet.","门位于客厅和厨房之间。		The door is between the living room and the kitchen.","阳台上放一把椅子，休息一下就好。		If you put a chair on the balcony, it's good to rest.","热情地打招呼可以改善家里的气氛。		Saying hello warmly improves the atmosphere in the house.","当你的房间太脏时你不会生气吗？		Don't you get annoyed when your room is too dirty?","宽敞的工作室		spacious studio","厨房和客厅之间没有墙。		There is no wall between the kitchen and living room."]],
  ["雨把前门弄得有点湿。",["雨把前门弄得有点湿。		The rain made the front door a little wet.","当客人到达时，将鞋子放入鞋柜中。		When guests arrive, put your shoes in the shoe closet.","餐桌位于冰箱和窗户之间。		The dining table is located between the refrigerator and the window.","餐桌位于厨房和窗户之间。		The dining table stands between the kitchen and the window.","鞋柜和门之间有一把雨伞。		There is an umbrella between the shoe closet and the door.","鞋柜太小，鞋子不合脚。		The shoe closet is too small, the shoes don't fit well.","包裹今天早上到达，所以我有点惊讶。		The package arrived this morning, so I was a little surprised.","工作室里有衣柜，方便。		There is a closet in the studio, which is convenient.","工作室的衣柜太小了。		The closet in the studio is too small.","在这个房间里，一个机器人正在清洁地板。		In this room, a robot is cleaning the floor.","如果你在这张沙发前拍照，你的脸会显得很轻。		If you take a photo in front of this sofa, your face will look light.","晚上前门有点暗。		In the evenings the front door is a little dark.","多亏了窗户，房子看起来总是明亮的。		Thanks to the windows, the house always looks bright.","打开窗户使房间看起来更明亮。		Opening a window makes the room look brighter.","如果你打开窗户，房子看起来就明亮多了。		If you open the window, the house looks much lighter.","很多朋友也住单间公寓。		Many friends also live in studio apartments.","<装修过的客厅>		<living room that was decorated>","有客人来家里时，请先打招呼。		When a guest comes to the house, please say hello first.","一切准备就绪，迎接客人。		Everything is ready to welcome the guest.","一切准备就绪，等待明天的客人见面。		Everything is ready for tomorrow's meeting of the guest.","明天的惊喜派对你准备好了吗？		Have you prepared everything for the surprise party tomorrow?","你也可以给我播放一下你准备的音乐吗？		Can you also play me the music you prepared?","大家一起唱歌。他们也跳舞。		Everyone sang together. And they danced too.","我怀念那些我们一起欢笑的时刻。		I miss those moments when we all laughed together.","我会和朋友一起看烟花。		I'll gather with friends to watch the fireworks.","你购买并带来的饮料		the drink you bought and brought","我还想邀请老师参加我们的活动。		I would also like to invite teachers to our event.","我把我的愿望写在纸上，埋在院子里。		I wrote down my wish on paper and buried it in the yard.","最小的，还没收到礼物		the youngest, who still has not received the gift","今晚的聚会将真正令人难忘。		Tonight's party will be truly unforgettable.","我们都准备好参加惊喜派对了吗？		Are we all prepared for the surprise party?","我希望我们的班级活动真正特别。		I want our class event to be truly special.","您喜欢我们的新邀请吗？		How do you like our new invitation?","我为这次活动准备了传统菜肴。		I prepared traditional dishes for the event.","因为有毕业典礼，所以我一大早就起床了。		There was a graduation ceremony, so I got up early in the morning.","我在朋友常去的花店买了花。		I bought flowers at a flower shop where my friend often went.","我一直在看书，所以很有趣。		I read books all the time, so it’s interesting.","拍照的时候对我来说是最享受的。		The time when I take photographs is the most enjoyable for me.","我对摄影的热情在于寻找小细节。		My passion for photography is the search for small details.","当你做运动的时候，我画了一幅画。		while you were playing sports, I drew a picture."]],
  ["事实上，去年有更多的时间玩游戏。",["事实上，去年有更多的时间玩游戏。		In fact, last year there was much more time for games.","对电子产品的新热情		new passion for electronics","我也喜欢手绘。		I also like to draw by hand.","穿着简单的衣服拍照比较方便。		It was more convenient to take pictures in simple clothes.","我以前经常弹钢琴，但最近不会了。		I used to play the piano often, but lately I can't.","来我们常去的公园试试拍照吧？		Let's try to take pictures in a park where we often went?","我有很多有类似经历的朋友。		I have many friends with similar experiences.","在这些假期里我会尝试培养一种实用的爱好。		During these holidays I will try to take up a practical hobby.","电子仪器		electronic instrument","电子玩具		electronic toy","电子爱好		electronic hobby","我朋友常去的公园很安静。		The park where my friend often goes is quiet.","我买了朋友推荐的相册来试用。		I bought a photo album that a friend recommended to try out.","这真是一个风景非常美丽的地方。		This is a place where the scenery is really beautiful.","我仍然怀念以前在学校外面吃的炒年糕。		I still miss the tteokbokki I used to eat outside school.","咖啡馆在中间		cafe in the middle","准备小组项目花了很长时间。		It took a really long time to prepare for the group project.","如果我们很好地完成了小组项目，我们的成绩也会提高。		If we finish a group project well, our grades will also increase.","其实，我还没来得及准备期中考试呢。		Actually, I haven't managed to study for the midterm exam yet.","你想和谁在同一组？		Who do you want to be in the same group with?","没有其他选择，所以我只能遵循。		There was no other choice, so I had to follow.","有时看起来作业太多了。		Sometimes it seems like there is too much homework.","有时想要放松		sometimes the desire to relax","学习了一晚上，有点累了。		I studied all night and was a little tired.","新学期的一切你都准备好了吗？		Have you prepared everything for the new semester?","新学期需要准备的东西你买好了吗？		Have you bought the things you need to prepare for the new semester?","为了准备考试，看来我得看课本了。		In preparation for the exam, it looks like I'll have to read the textbook.","看来我得牺牲周末来准备考试了。		It looks like I'll have to sacrifice my weekend to prepare for the exam.","提前开始准备考试，心情平静了一些。		Having started preparing for the exam in advance, I feel a little calmer.","考试很多的时候，你不觉得压力很大吗？		When there are a lot of exams, don't you feel stressed?","任务很困难，所以我不得不请教老师。		The task was difficult, so I had to ask the teacher.","我在高二的时候认识了那个朋友。		I met that friend in my second year of high school.","最初，我不擅长运动。		Initially, I was not good at sports.","如果成绩低，就得重新学习。		If the grade is low, you will have to study again.","有计划为期中考试学习吗？		Have a plan to study for your midterm exam?","他们说，期中考试时间表已经发布。		The midterm exam schedule has already been released, they say.","如果您有商务会议，请告诉我。		If you have a meeting between business, tell me.","我有机会参加体育比赛。		I had the opportunity to participate in sports competitions.","因为上学的原因，我总是没有足够的时间。		Because of school, I always don't have enough time.","学校生活压力很大，时间总是不够用。		School life is stressful, there is never enough time."]],
  ["你知道教授的办公室在哪里吗？",["你知道教授的办公室在哪里吗？		Do you happen to know where the professor's office is?","我只留下了一些饼干，对吧？		I only left a few cookies, right?","在这种情况下，正式问候语的发音必须正确。		In such cases, the formal greeting must be pronounced correctly.","明年我也期待你们的支持。		Next year I also count on your support.","明年我请求你们的支持。		And next year I ask for your support.","如果有人可以帮忙，请介绍给我。		If there is anyone who can help, introduce me to him.","新的一年我指望你。		And I’m counting on you in the new year.","如果我们互相介绍自己，沟通就会变得很舒服。		If we introduce ourselves to each other, communication can become comfortable.","有困难的时候，互相帮助是件好事。		When it’s difficult, it’s good to help each other.","我今天睡过头了，所以聚会有点迟到了。		I overslept today, so I was a little late for the party.","今天的新年晚会气氛真好。		There's a really good atmosphere at the New Year's party today.","我想介绍一位第一次来参加我们会议的朋友。		I would like to introduce a friend who came to our meeting for the first time.","我们要求把音乐调小一点。		We asked to turn down the music a little.","你能再倒一点饮料吗？		Can you pour a little more drink?","在这次忘年会上我认识了很多人。		I met a lot of people at this year-end party.","聚会结束后我打算晚起。		After the party I plan to wake up late.","我将向您发送一封有关活动日程的电子邮件。		I will send you an email regarding the event schedule.","一个我几乎从未去过的地方		a place I've almost never been","对比赛结果进行投注的人		person who bets on the outcome of a match","为了学习如何绘画，我进入了一所艺术学校。		To learn how to draw, I enrolled in an art school.","我要去附近的公园散步。		I'm going for a walk in the park nearby.","我用数码相机给我的朋友们拍了很好的照片。		I take good photographs of my friends with a digital camera.","我将在很长一段时间以来第一次锻炼身体。		I'm going to work out for the first time in a long time.","我的朋友也想去听音乐会。		My friend also wants to go to the concert.","你的日程安排中最期待的是什么？		What are you looking forward to most in your schedule?","我真的很期待你用数码相机拍摄的照片。		I'm really looking forward to the photos you took with your digital camera.","为了提高我的听力，我经常看韩国电视剧。		To improve my listening comprehension, I often watch Korean TV series.","品尝乐趣		tasting pleasure","我要去寻找一家好的餐馆。		I'm going to look for a good restaurant.","雨下得很大，我几乎没有出去。		It was raining so hard that I hardly went outside.","因为下大雨，我几乎没有出去。		Because of the heavy rain, I hardly went outside.","如果你经常练习新单词，那就很好。		If you practice new words a lot, it's good.","没时间，几乎没看电影。		There was no time, I almost didn’t watch movies.","为了准备考试，我报名了在线讲座。		To prepare for the exam, I signed up for online lectures.","为了在考试中取得好成绩，我努力学习。		To do well in the exam, I study hard.","我每天上课都是为了准备考试。		I take classes every day to prepare for the exam.","昨天太忙了，几乎没有时间四处看看。		Yesterday I was too busy, so I hardly had time to look around.","想吃什么随时选！		Choose what you want to eat at any time!","随时交谈		any time to talk","当你想放松的任何一天		any day when you want to relax"]],
  ["本周老师向我们介绍了一个新游戏。",["本周老师向我们介绍了一个新游戏。		This week the teacher introduced us to a new game.","借助在线讲座，即使在家也可以轻松学习。		Thanks to online lectures, even at home you can study easily.","我在日程安排中添加了看电影的时间。		I added time to watch a movie to my schedule.","我们一起尝试的甜点		dessert that we try together","多亏了那个人行横道，我才能轻松过马路。		Thanks to that pedestrian crossing, I was able to cross the road easily.","每个省都有不同的气氛，所以很奇怪。		Each province has a different atmosphere, so it's surprising.","当我探索该地区时，我发现了一个图书馆。		While I was exploring the area, I found a library.","在去探索该地区的路上，我发现了一家便利店。		On the way, going to explore the area, I found a convenience store.","如果你打开门并返回，你会看到一部电梯。		If you open the door and go back, you will see an elevator.","新房门前，公交车站就在附近，出行方便。		In front of the new house, the bus stop is close, so it’s convenient.","我喜欢新房子旁边有一个公园。		I like that there is a park next to the new house.","新房子真的很宽敞，我很喜欢。		The new house is really spacious, so I like it.","我正在路上，把东西搬到新房子。		I'm on the road, taking things to a new house.","没有红绿灯过马路有点危险。		Crossing without a traffic light was a bit dangerous.","扔完垃圾后，我回来了。		After throwing out the trash, I come back.","如果你走到建筑物后面，你会看到一个垃圾桶。		If you go behind the building, you will see a trash can.","我慢慢地环顾房子。		I slowly look around the house.","昨天剩下的东西都在房间里。		Things left over from yesterday are in the room.","前一天晚上睡得很晚的朋友		friend who went to bed late the night before","前一天准备的盒子还有很多。		There are still a lot of boxes prepared the day before.","由于济州岛是一个岛屿，所以离海很近。		Since Jeju is an island, the sea is close.","停车场就在附近，所以去那里很方便。		Parking is nearby, so getting there is convenient.","上个月我们一起去看公寓。		Last month we went to look at apartments together.","如果你把东西拆开，你很快就会习惯的。		If you take things apart, you'll soon get used to it.","河流从房子流向西北。		From the house the river flows to the northwest.","将书柜向前移动一点。		Move the bookcase forward a little.","在去学校的路上我看到一家新开张的商店。		On the way to school I saw a recently opened store.","在去学校的路上你可以看到一个美丽的公园。		On the way to school you can see a beautiful park.","明天也能在露台上放松一下就好了。		It would be nice to relax on the terrace tomorrow too.","你最想乘坐哪趟车？		What ride do you most want to go on?","大家一起去营地做饭吧。		Everyone, let's cook together at the camp.","据说新的游乐园有很多不寻常的景点。		The new amusement park is said to have many unusual attractions.","昨天制作的箭头今天仍然可以使用。		Arrows made yesterday can still be used today.","我们去游乐园玩所有的游乐设施吧。		Let's go to the amusement park and ride all the rides.","也许我们可以聚在一起去露营？		Maybe we can all get together and go camping?","让我们在旅途中拍张照片吧！		Let's all take a photo while we're on the ride!","让我们吃美味的食物，开心一整天。		Let's eat delicious food and have fun all day long.","我们也准备一下营地里做饭用的食物吧。		Let's also prepare food for cooking in the camp.","你准备好应对火灾的一切了吗？		Have you prepared everything for the fire?","露台上放了鲜花，更加美丽了。		Flowers were placed on the terrace, it became even more beautiful."]],
  ["去河岸野餐怎么样？",["去河岸野餐怎么样？		How about a riverbank for a picnic?","野餐时我也想玩游戏。		At the picnic I also want to play games.","如果能在海岸上看到烟花那就太棒了。		It would be great to see fireworks on the coast.","晴朗的早晨，大海的声音非常好听。		On a clear morning, the sound of the sea is very pleasant.","好在有很多接近的机会。		It’s good that there are many opportunities to get closer.","我也想听听你灵魂深处的声音。		I also want to listen to what’s in your soul.","你是第一个轻松说话的，这也让我感觉好一些。		You were the first to speak at ease, and it made me feel better too.","我最好的朋友善于倾听我的忧虑。		My best friend is good at listening to my worries.","让我们继续好好相处吧。		Let's continue to get along well.","最近你和我变得更亲密了。		Lately you and I have become closer.","我想和一位同事共进晚餐。		I want to have dinner with a colleague.","我们稍后会去的一家商店		a store we'll visit a little later","稍后在餐厅见我。		Meet me at the restaurant a little later.","和朋友开玩笑的时候是最愉快的。		The time when I joke with a friend is the most enjoyable.","你通常谈论最多的是什么？		What do you usually talk a lot about?","你还记得我们曾经一起散步的公园吗？		Do you remember the park where we used to walk together?","会议结束后，我们稍后会在餐厅见面。		We'll meet at the restaurant a little later, after the meeting ends.","在工程实验室我进行了各种研究。		In the engineering laboratory I carried out various studies.","我会尝试直接将图表的解释翻译成英文。		I will try to directly translate the explanation of the diagram into English.","如果您仔细研究图表，很容易找到重要信息。		If you study the chart carefully, important information is easy to find.","我什么时候可以进入实验室？		When can I get access to the laboratory?","电缆有不同类型，每种都有其自己的用途。		There are different types of cables, each with its own purpose.","随着电的发明，日常生活发生了许多变化。		With the invention of electricity, many changes occurred in everyday life.","我要出版一本关于电力的书。		I'm going to publish a book about the power of electricity.","文中有些地方难以理解。		There are places in the text that are difficult to understand.","请简要概括课文内容。		Please briefly summarize the content of the text.","我有机会收集有关外国商品的信息。		I had the opportunity to collect information about foreign goods.","所有的肌肉都痛得很厉害，你可能会死。		All the muscles hurt so much that you could die.","这么热，好想吃冰啊！		So hot, I'm dying to eat ice!","我出汗了，热得快要死了。		I'm sweating, so hot I'm dying.","我出汗太多，快要死了。		I'm sweating so much I'm dying.","跳远训练		long jump training","做了一个蛋糕来庆祝胜利。		Made a cake to celebrate the victory.","我拍下了胜利的时刻。		I photographed the moment of victory.","由于训练繁重，我快要困死了。		Due to heavy training, I'm dying of sleepiness.","如果队长不在场，我们就不会赢。		If the captain had not been there, we would not have won.","当第一个进球进球时，情绪达到了顶峰。		When the first goal was scored, emotions were at their peak.","教练逼得我快要死了。		The coach is driving me so hard that I will die.","高尔夫是一项可以帮助您管理时间的好运动。		Golf is a good sport that helps you manage time.","我每天早上也起得很早，做好准备。		I also get up early every morning and get ready."]],
  ["你提前检查过明天要使用的文件吗？",["你提前检查过明天要使用的文件吗？		Have you checked the file you will be using tomorrow in advance?","明天这个时候我可能会在去办公室的路上。		Tomorrow at this time I will probably be on the way to the office.","当我听你大声朗读的故事时，我理解得更好。		When I listen to a story you read out loud, I understand better.","如果有圈子开会，可以给我发消息吗？		If there is a meeting of the circle, can you send me a message?","我想每天早起并实现我的目标。		I want to wake up early every day and achieve my goals.","实现目标的那一刻是最幸福的。		The moment when you achieve a goal is the happiest.","多亏了晨练，我才能顺利地开始新的一天。		Thanks to morning exercises I can start the day well.","当我早上准备的时候，他们打来电话。		While I was getting ready in the morning, they called.","早上一边准备，一边看新闻。		While getting ready in the morning, I also watch the news.","每天早上我都有点忙着准备上课。		Every morning I'm a little busy getting ready for classes.","我想通过每天早上锻炼来实现我的目标。		I want to achieve my goal by exercising every morning.","今天早上我刚刚在读报纸。		I was just reading the newspaper this morning.","隔壁房间传来网课的声音。		The sound of an online lesson can be heard from the next room.","今天我把勺子和筷子也洗干净了。		Today I also washed the spoon and chopsticks clean.","今天我也在浴室洗了脸。		Today I also washed my face in the bathroom.","下午三点我们将开会。		At three o'clock in the afternoon we will be at a meeting.","由于要上网课，我经常足不出户。		Due to online classes, I often do not leave the house.","我现在打电话是为了解决互联网问题。		I'm calling now to solve a problem with the Internet.","如果您没有互联网连接，您甚至无法观看新闻。		If you don't have an Internet connection, you can't even watch the news.","如果你改变你的日常生活，你就可以养成新的习惯。		If you change your daily routine, you can develop new habits.","文件太多，我们需要整理一下。		There are too many files, we need to put things in order.","在线学校课程		online school lessons","这是一个关于为什么你不应该撒谎的故事。		This is a story about why you shouldn't lie.","结果确实令人惊讶。		The result is truly amazing.","最终公主鼓起勇气解决了问题。		Eventually the princess plucked up courage and solved the problem.","他们说丰富的经验很重要。		They said that wealth of experience is important.","你说的比恐怖片还糟糕。		What you said is worse than a horror movie.","你不能在那棵树下拍照。		You can't take pictures under that tree.","他们说那个湖里生活着一条巨大的鱼。		They say that a huge fish lives in that lake.","你也喜欢巨人出现的故事吗？		Did you also like stories where a giant appears?","你觉得公主是个什么样的人？		What kind of person do you think the princess is?","令人惊讶的是，突然从树后传来了声音。		Surprisingly, suddenly a sound was heard from behind the tree.","令人惊讶的是，帐篷附近传来了奇怪的声音。		Surprisingly, a strange sound was heard near the tent.","如果有人从后面吓到我，我会退缩。		If someone scares me from behind, I flinch.","精彩队长		wonderful captain","可以看到一个被火照亮的巨大物体。		A huge object illuminated by fire was visible.","守船的船长看上去很酷。		The captain guarding the ship looked very cool.","由于黑暗，很难看清附近人的脸。		Because of the darkness, the face of the person nearby is difficult to see.","我小时候看的这部电影真是令人震惊。		The film I saw as a child was a real shock.","我们常去的山很危险。		The mountain where we often go is dangerous."]],
  ["我们之前听到那边有奇怪的声音。",["我们之前听到那边有奇怪的声音。		We heard a strange sound over there before.","后面那棵老树很危险。		That old tree back there is dangerous.","他们说那片森林里隐藏着一个诱人的秘密。		They say that there is an attractive secret hidden in that forest.","敌人突然出现，大家都非常害怕，他们说。		The enemy suddenly appeared, and everyone was very scared, they say.","在绝望的时刻，队长鼓起勇气。		In a desperate moment, the captain plucked up his courage.","主角有很大的勇气。		The main character had a lot of courage.","主角是一个善良的人。		The main character is a kind person.","房屋被抢的人们不知道该怎么办。		People whose houses were robbed did not know what to do.","为了吓唬我的朋友，我从后面上来。		To scare my friend, I came up from behind.","很高的巨人		very tall giant","兔子半路睡着了。		The rabbit fell asleep halfway.","随着午睡时间的临近，让我们做好准备。		As nap time approaches, let's get ready.","是时候从游乐场回来了。		It's time to return from the playground.","如果你太晚开灯，你的眼睛会受伤。		If you leave the lights on too late, your eyes hurt.","我又开始发牢骚了，因为弟弟先玩了。		I was grumbling again because the younger one played the game first.","如果最后表扬，孩子会更喜欢。		If you praise at the end, children like it more.","爬楼梯并抓住栏杆更安全。		It's safer to climb stairs and hold on to the railing.","按下开关，给我开灯。		Push the switch, turn on the light for me.","今天我也要按时做作业。		Today I also need to do my homework on time.","午餐后我想一起在公园里度过时光。		After lunch I want to spend time together in the park.","还记得我们上次做的开胃菜吗？		Remember the appetizer we made last time?","看书入睡的习惯		habit of putting to sleep by reading a book","我需要看书然后去睡觉。		I need to read a book and go to bed.","准备交易文件花了很多时间。		It took a lot of time to prepare the transaction documents.","在竞争环境下，企业的生存可能会变得更加困难。		In a competitive environment, survival of companies may become more difficult.","国际品质得到认可。		International quality is recognized.","如果你能很好地管理最后期限，你就能取得更好的结果。		If you manage deadlines well, you can achieve better results.","如果这个合同成功，我们也计划从其他国家进口货物。		If this contract is successful, we plan to import goods from other countries as well.","交易成功		successful transaction","转账的结果是，由于汇率差异，进来的钱减少了。		As a result of the transfer, less money came in due to the exchange rate difference.","这次国际转账，费率并没有想象中那么优惠。		This time, when transferring internationally, the rate was not as favorable as expected.","我将在明天之前提交损失报告。		I will submit the loss report by tomorrow.","如果限制取消了，是不是各种商品都进不来了？		If restrictions disappear, won't a variety of goods be able to come in?","这次大会的代表中有不少来自保守派阵营的人。		Among the deputies of this convocation there are many people from the conservative camp.","领导人不仅要听取多数人的意见，还要听取少数人的意见。		A leader must listen not only to the majority, but also to the voices of the minority.","如果有坡道，坐轮椅的人也可以轻松进入。		If there is a ramp, people in wheelchairs can also enter easily.","因此，残疾人之间的沟通存在很多障碍。		Therefore, there are many obstacles in communication between people with disabilities.","如果有不同的便利设施，每个人都更容易使用它们。		If there are different amenities, it is easier for everyone to use them.","当噪音很大时，你甚至听不到自己的声音。		When the noise is strong, you can't even hear your voice.","在浴室里也是如此，如果有扶手，那就更安全了。		In the bathroom, too, if there is a grab bar, it is safer."]],
  ["残疾人停车位也可以通过信息亭找到。",["残疾人停车位也可以通过信息亭找到。		The location of parking for people with disabilities can also be found through the kiosk.","如果有更多的机会参与，大家都会更开心。		If there are more opportunities to participate, everyone will be happier.","我再次为我的缺勤向我的老板道歉。		I will once again apologize to my boss for being absent from work.","我缺席当天的工作由我接手并完成。		I will take over the work during the day of my absence and complete it.","就算你怪我，我也无话可说。		Even if you blame me, I have nothing to say.","我想这都是因为我的错误。		I think it's all because of my mistake.","非常抱歉，我的粗心让您感到不舒服。		I am very sorry that my carelessness made you feel uncomfortable.","对不愉快的事件表现出歉意		looking apologetic about an unpleasant incident","由于行动仓促，该计划不得不取消。		Due to hasty action, the plan had to be cancelled.","如果不是加班的话，我本来就能履行协议的，可惜了。		If I didn't have to work overtime, I would have been able to honor the agreement, it's a pity.","我将很快报告与此错误相关的措施。		I will report soon on measures in connection with this error.","这周的工作量很大，所以很难找到时间。		There's a lot of work this week, so it's hard to find time.","抱歉，下次我一定会再检查一次。		Sorry, but next time I'll definitely check it again.","我无法集中注意力，所以我最终错过了机会。		I couldn't concentrate, so I ended up missing the opportunity.","如果有任何额外损坏，请报告。		If there is any additional damage, please report.","允许每个人选择的关系是健康的。		Relationships that allow everyone to choose are healthy.","给予每个人自由也很重要。		Giving everyone freedom is also important.","即使距离变远，彼此惆怅的感觉也不会改变。		Even if the distance becomes greater, the feeling of mutual melancholy does not change.","现在连他都走了，一个人也没有了。		Now even he is gone, there is no one left.","在街上，经常可以看到一对情侣拥抱在一起。		On the street, a couple can often be seen hugging.","在人际关系中表达爱意非常重要。		Showing affection in relationships is really important.","爱越深，我们就越了解彼此。		The deeper the love, the better we understand each other.","我喜欢性格比外表更有吸引力的人。		I like people whose character is more attractive than their appearance.","即使这样也无助于克服分手。		Even this did not help overcome the breakup.","当我们在重要时刻拥抱时，我们的心会变得更近。		When we hug at important moments, our hearts become closer.","共情能力		ability to empathize","对于一位保守派政治家来说，他对多样性感兴趣。		For a conservative politician, he has an interest in diversity.","多样性可以带来更具创造性的解决方案。		Diversity can lead to more creative solutions.","教育是必要的，这样每个人都能理解多样性的价值。		Education is necessary so that everyone can understand the value of diversity.","不同的同理心经历		diverse experiences of empathy","当每个人都关心时，就会创造出更自由的氛围。		When everyone cares, a freer atmosphere is created.","按照我父母那一代人的标准，多样性是令人兴奋的。		By the standards of my parents' generation, diversity is exciting.","按照我父母那一代人的标准，多样性很有趣。		By the standards of my parents' generation, diversity is interesting.","为了沟通无障碍，相互尊重是必要的。		In order to communicate without inconvenience, mutual respect is necessary.","如果你尊重隐私，你们就可以更加信任彼此。		If you respect privacy, you can trust each other more.","我尽量不让对话者感到不舒服。		I try not to make my interlocutor feel uncomfortable.","夫妻之间相互理解的关系		relationship between spouses with mutual understanding","尊重选择的氛围		atmosphere of respect for choice","尊重选择		respect for choices","选择委婉的说话方式		choice of tactful manner of speech"]],
  ["选择配饰时，最好考虑对方的品味。",["选择配饰时，最好考虑对方的品味。		When choosing accessories, it's good to consider the other person's tastes.","您认为尊​​重多样性的方法有哪些？		What do you think are some ways to respect diversity?","对于一家大公司来说，他们对多元化了解不多。		For a large company, they don't know much about diversity.","对于一个韩国人来说，他对综艺有着极大的兴趣。		For a Korean, he has a great interest in variety.","我的哥哥和妹妹犯了错误！		My older brother and younger sister made a mistake!","敏君，一定要关电脑和灯！		Minjun, be sure to turn off the computer and lights!","敏俊，你和你哥哥一起去机房了吗？		Minjun, did you go to the PC room with your brother?","安娜，这个机房的服务真的好吗？		Anna, is the service at this PC room really good?"]]
